return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache-pro','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache-pro','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:37:32+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:37:32+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache-pro'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache-pro','A complete caching and optimisation engine for WordPress: full-page cache, object cache, database cleanup and CSS/JS optimisation. Install this when your host does not provide a cache layer of its own — on Zinn Digital® hosting install Zinn® Cache instead. Full-page caching requires a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed server with the LSCache module. A GPLv3 fork of the LiteSpeed Cache plugin.'=>'Ẹrọ ìpamọ́ àti ìmúṣẹ́ tó pé lẹ́kùn-únrẹ́rẹ́ fún WordPress: ìpamọ́ ojú-ewé kíkún, ìpamọ́ ohun anlu, ìwẹ̀nùmọ́ ìplọ́ọ̀dù (database) àti ìtòjọ CSS/JS. Fi èyí sori ẹ̀rọ nígbà tí ilé-iṣẹ́ tó ń gbalejo rẹ kò bá pèsè ìpele ìpamọ́ tirẹ̀ — sori ìgbalejo Zinn Digital® fi Zinn® Cache sori ẹ̀rọ dípò rẹ̀. Ìpamọ́ ojú-ewé kíkún ń béèrè fún ẹ̀rọ-ìṣéṣe LiteSpeed tàbí OpenLiteSpeed pẹ̀lú mọ́dùlù LSCache. Èka GPLv3 kan ti kọ́ọ̀nì (plugin) LiteSpeed Cache.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','%d hours'=>'Awọn wakati %d','%d hour'=>'%d wakati','%d minutes'=>'Ìṣẹ́jú %d','%d minute'=>'Ìṣẹ́jú %d','Purged All!'=>'Ti nu gbogbo rẹ kuro!','Purged the blog!'=>'A ti nu bulọọgi naa kuro!','Purged the URL!'=>'A ti nu URL yẹn kuro!','Purged!'=>'Ti sọ di mimọ!','Failed to upgrade.'=>'Ikuna lati ṣe imudojuiwọn.','Upgraded successfully.'=>'Wọ́n ti ṣe àfikún agbára ní àṣeyọrí.','Dashboard'=>'Dashboard','OptimaX'=>'OptimaX','Presets'=>'Àwọn ètò tẹ́lẹ̀ṣẹ̀lẹ̀','General'=>'Igbakani','Cache'=>'Kọ́ṣìi','CDN'=>'CDN','Image Optimization'=>'Ìmúṣe Àwòrán','Page Optimization'=>'Ìmúṣẹ Ojúewé','Database'=>'Àpèjọ ìpamọ́tàkọ̀','Crawler'=>'Olùṣàyẹ̀wò wẹ́bù','Toolbox'=>'Àpò irinṣẹ́','Cookie Name'=>'Orúkọ Kuki','Cookie Values'=>'Àwọn Ìwúlò Kuki','Remove cookie simulation'=>'Yọ àṣàkóòpù (cookie) kúrò','Add new cookie to simulate'=>'Fi kuki titun kun si láti ṣe àwòkọ̀','CDN URL to be used. For example, %s'=>'CDN URL lati lo. Fun apẹẹrẹ, %s','Remove CDN URL'=>'Yọ URL CDN silẹ','Add new CDN URL'=>'Fi URL CDN tuntun kun','ON'=>'LÉ','OFF'=>'PA PAJU','Settings'=>'Ètò','Dismiss'=>'Pa kuro','Save Changes'=>'Fipamọ Awọn Ayipada','This value is overwritten by the %s variable.'=>'Ohun tí wọ́n kọ sí orí rẹ̀ ni a fioǹkan yìí rọ́pò: %s.','This value is overwritten by the filter.'=>'Àlàyé yìí ti rọ́pọ̀ nipasẹ àléfẹ̀ẹ́ náà.','This value is overwritten by the PHP constant %s.'=>'Aṣọ yìí ti kọjá lórí nipasẹ ohun elo PHP %s.','This value is overwritten by the primary site setting.'=>'Ìye yìí jẹ́ ìkọ̀tí lórí nípa ètò ojú òpó wẹ́bù àkọ́kọ́.','This value is overwritten by the Network setting.'=>'Èrò yìí ti di àtúnkọ nípasẹ̀ ètò Nẹ́twọ́kì.','Currently set to %s'=>'Lọwọlọwọ o wa sori %s','Value from filter applied'=>'Iye lati ninu àlẹ̀mọ́ ti a lo','seconds'=>'àáyá','Default value'=>'Iye àiyàṣe','Invalid rewrite rule'=>'Ofin àtúnkọ tí kò tọ́','Path must end with %s'=>'Ọ̀nà gbọdọ̀ parí pẹ̀lú %s','Minimum value'=>'Iye ti o kere ju','Maximum value'=>'Iye ti o ga julọ','Zero, or'=>'Odo, tabi','Larger than'=>'Tobi ju','Smaller than'=>'Kékeré ju','Value range'=>'Iwọn iye','Invalid IP'=>'IP ti ko tọ','API'=>'API','Server variable(s) %s available to override this setting.'=>'Awọn oniyipada sẹ́fà (server variable) %s wà láti sọ ètò yìí di asán.','The URLs will be compared to the REQUEST_URI server variable.'=>'A ma fi awọn URL wọwe pẹlu iyipada sẹ́fà REQUEST_URI.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ, fún %1$s, a lè lo %2$s níbí.','To match the beginning, add %s to the beginning of the item.'=>'Lati bá ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀ mu, fi %s kún ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ohun náà.','To do an exact match, add %s to the end of the URL.'=>'Lati ṣe ìbámu gangan, fi %s kún òpin URL naa.','One per line.'=>'Ọkan fún ìlà kọọkan.','%s groups'=>'Awọn ẹgbẹ %s','%s images'=>'Àwọn àwòrán %s','%s group'=>'Ẹgbẹ %s','%s image'=>'%s àwòrán','No fields'=>'Ko si awọn aaye','The user with id %s has editor access, which is not allowed for the role simulator.'=>'Olumulo ti o ni id %s ni wiwọle olutunṣe, eyiti ko gba laaye fun olufihan ipa.','Options saved.'=>'Awon aṣayan ti fipamọ.','Notified Cloudflare to set development mode to %s successfully.'=>'Aṣeyọri ninu fifiranṣẹ leti sí Cloudflare láti ṣètò ipò ìdàgbàsókè sí %s.','Cloudflare API is set to off.'=>'A ti pa Cloudflare API.','Notified Cloudflare to purge all successfully.'=>'A sọ fún Cloudflare láti pa ohun gbogbo rẹ́ pẹ̀lú àṣeyọrí.','No available Cloudflare zone'=>'Kò sí agbègbè Cloudflare tí ó wà fún lílò','Failed to communicate with Cloudflare'=>'Kò lè bá Cloudflare sọ̀rọ̀','Communicated with Cloudflare successfully.'=>'Aṣeyọri ba Cloudflare sọ̀rọ̀.','Failed to validate %s activation data.'=>'Ko le jẹrisi data imuṣiṣẹ %s.','Failed to parse %s activation status.'=>'O kùn láti túmọ̀ ipò ìmúṣẹ %s.','%s activation data expired.'=>'%s data activation ti pari.','Congratulations, %s successfully set this domain up for the anonymous online services.'=>'A ku oriire, %s ti ṣeto agbegbe yii ni aṣeyọri fun awọn iṣẹ afororo lori ayelujara.','Congratulations, %s successfully set this domain up for the online services.'=>'Ẹ kú oriire, %s ti ṣaṣeyọri lati ṣètò agbegbe yìí fun awọn iṣẹ lori ayelujara.','Congratulations, %s successfully set this domain up for the online services with CDN service.'=>'Ẹ ku oriire, %s ti ṣeto agbegbe yii ni aṣeyọri fun awọn iṣẹ ori ayelujara pẹlu iṣẹ CDN.','Site not recognized. QUIC.cloud deactivated automatically. Please reactivate your QUIC.cloud account.'=>'A kò mọ ojula wẹẹbù yìí. A ti pa QUIC.cloud rẹ́ fúngba díẹ̀ fúnrarẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ tún QUIC.cloud akawunti rẹ bẹ̀rẹ̀.','Click here to proceed.'=>'Tẹ ibi lati tẹsiwaju.','QUIC.cloud\'s access to your WP REST API seems to be blocked.'=>'Ó dabi pe iraye si WP REST API rẹ nipasẹ QUIC.cloud ti di mọlẹ.','Failed to get echo data from WPAPI'=>'Ikuna lati gba data echo lati WPAPI','You need to set the %1$s first. Please use the command %2$s to set.'=>'O ni lati kọkọ ṣeto %1$s. Jọwọ lo aṣẹ %2$s lati ṣeto.','Server IP'=>'IP Olupèsè','You need to activate QC first.'=>'O ni lati mu QC ṣiṣẹ kọkọ.','Cert or key file does not exist.'=>'Fáìlì ìríjú tàbí kọ́ọ̀sì kò sí.','Reset %s activation successfully.'=>'A ti tun %s bẹrẹ pẹlu aṣeyọri.','Linked to QUIC.cloud preview environment, for testing purpose only.'=>'Ó jọ mọ́ àyíká àyẹ̀wò QUIC.cloud, fún ète ìdánwò nìkan.','Cloud Error'=>'Àṣìṣe Ìkọ̀gbìn (Cloud Error)','No available Cloud Node after checked server load.'=>'Ko si Cloud Node ti o wa lẹhin ti a ṣayẹwo ẹru olupin.','No available Cloud Node.'=>'Kò sí Cloud Node tó wà látòunwá.','In order to use QC services, need a real domain name, cannot use an IP.'=>'Lati le lo awọn iṣẹ QC, o nilo orukọ ìkansí (domain name) gidi, o ko le lo IP kan.','Please try after %1$s for service %2$s.'=>'Jọ̀ọ̀ gbiyanju lẹhin %1$s fun iṣẹ %2$s.','Failed to request via WordPress'=>'O kuna lati beere nipasẹ WordPress','Cloud server refused the current request due to unpulled images. Please pull the images first.'=>'Olupèsè ojú-òpóró kọ̀ láti gba ìbéèrè lọ́wọ́ nítorí àwọn àwòrán tí a kò tíì fà jáde. Jọ̀wọ́ fà áwọn àwòrán náà jáde níṣáájú.','Your domain_key has been temporarily blocklisted to prevent abuse. You may contact support at QUIC.cloud to learn more.'=>'A ti fi domain_key rẹ sori atokọ idinamọ fun igba diẹ lati dena ilokulo. O le kan si atilẹyin ni QUIC.cloud lati ni imọ si i.','Cloud server refused the current request due to rate limiting. Please try again later.'=>'Fífúnni ní iye àlàfo kọjá lórí ìbéèrè nítorí àlàkalẹ̀ ìwọ̀n ìṣiṣẹ́ ni sàláfà ìwọṣẹ́ kọ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ tún gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nígbà tó yẹ.','Redetected node'=>'Nọ́ọ̀dù tí a tún rí','We are working hard to improve your online service experience. The service will be unavailable while we work. We apologize for any inconvenience.'=>'A nṣiṣẹ kakaka lati ṣe ilọsiwaju iriri iṣẹ ori ayelujara rẹ. Iṣẹ naa kii yoo wa ni akoko ti a nṣiṣẹ lọwọ. A bẹrẹ fun eyikeyi aisedeede.','Message from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Ifiranṣẹ láti ọ̀dọ̀ sẹ́fà QUIC.cloud','Good news from QUIC.cloud server'=>'Ìròyìn ayọ̀ láti ọ̀dọ̀ ẹ̀rọ ìṣẹ̀ṣẹ́ QUIC.cloud','%1$s plugin version %2$s required for this action.'=>'Ẹ̀yà plọ́gìnnì %1$s %2$s ni a nílò fún ìgbésẹ̀ yìí.','Failed to communicate with QUIC.cloud server'=>'Ikuna lati ba olupin QUIC.cloud sọrọ','Sync QUIC.cloud status successfully.'=>'Fifi ipo QUIC.cloud síṣẹpọ yọori si rere.','Sync credit allowance with Cloud Server successfully.'=>'A mu ààyè kirediti ṣiṣẹpọ pọ̀ pẹ̀lú Cloud Server ní àṣeyọrí.','Saving option failed. IPv4 only for %s.'=>'Ikan yiyan ko kọja. IPv4 nikan fun %s.','Changed setting successfully.'=>'A yipada eto naa ni aṣeyọri.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge everything.'=>'A sọ fun LiteSpeed Web Server lati nu ohun gbogbo kuro.','Notified LiteSpeed Web Server to purge the list.'=>'A sọ fún LiteSpeed Web Server pé kí ó nu àtòjọ náà nù.','Sitemap cleaned successfully'=>'A ti nu maapu aaye rẹ mọ kuro daradara','No valid sitemap parsed for crawler.'=>'Kò sí sitemap tó ṣe é lò tí a yọ̀ǹda fún ẹni tí ń wá ojú opó wọlé.','Sitemap created successfully: %d items'=>'A kọ́ mọ̀lápà (sitemap) yọ̀ ọ́ yọ: %d àwọn ohun àlùmọ́ọ̀ni','Crawler disabled list is cleared! All crawlers are set to active! '=>'Akojọ àwọn olùwádìí (crawler) tí a ti mú kúrò ti di mímọ́! Gbogbo àwọn olùwádìí ni a ti ṣètò sí iṣẹ́!','Started async crawling'=>'Bẹrẹ wiwọ inu wẹbù async','Guest'=>'Àlejò','Manually added to blocklist'=>'Fi kún àtòjọ àwọn tí a dènà fúnra rẹ','Previously existed in blocklist'=>'Ti wa tẹlẹ ninu àtòkọ àwọn tí a dènà','The database has been upgrading in the background since %s. This message will disappear once upgrade is complete.'=>'A ti n ṣe àtúnṣe lórí ibi ìpamọ́ data náà ní ẹ̀yìn náà láti ìgbà %s. Ifiranṣẹ yii yoo parẹ ni kete ti atunṣe naa ba pari.','Clean all successfully.'=>'Gbogbo rẹ̀ ti mọ́ pátápátá.','Clean post revisions successfully.'=>'Ti nu awọn atunyẹwo ifiweranṣẹ nu daradara.','Clean orphaned post meta successfully.'=>'Ṣe àṣeyọri nínu wíwẹ́ meta ifiweranṣẹ tí kò ní olórí kúrò.','Clean auto drafts successfully.'=>'Aṣeyọri fọ àwọn àkọọkan tí a fi ẹ̀rọ ṣe láìlérò.','Clean trashed posts and pages successfully.'=>'Ṣe àwọn àpilẹ̀kọ àti ojú-ewé tí a sọ nù nù kúrò ní ọ̀nà tí ó pé.','Clean spam comments successfully.'=>'Pa awọn asọye spam rẹ nu pẹlu aṣeyọri.','Clean trashed comments successfully.'=>'Yọ awọn asọye ti a sọ nu kuro ni aṣeyọri.','Clean trackbacks and pingbacks successfully.'=>'Ṣe àwọn trackbacks àti pingbacks mọ́ títí láé.','Clean expired transients successfully.'=>'Wọn ti nu awọn akoko ti o kọja kuro daradara.','Clean all transients successfully.'=>'Tinu gbogbo ohun ti ko nilo ni aṣeyọri.','Optimized all tables.'=>'A ti mú gbogbo tabili dara si i.','Converted to InnoDB successfully.'=>'Wọ́n ti sọ di InnoDB ní àṣeyọrí.','Invalid log type.'=>'Orí log tí kò tọ́.','Log file not found.'=>'A ko ri fáìlì ìwọlé (log file).','This setting is %1$s for certain qualifying requests due to %2$s!'=>'Eto yii jẹ %1$s fun awọn ibeere kan ti o ni ẹtọ nitori %2$s!','This setting will regenerate crawler list and clear the disabled list!'=>'Eto yii yoo tun atokọ olùwádìí (crawler) ṣe yoo si nu atokọ ti a ti sọ di alailagbara kuro!','This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily.'=>'Ojula yii nlo caching lati le jẹ ki akoko idahun yara ati iriri olumulo dara julọ. Caching le tọju ikawe ẹda ti gbogbo oju-iwe wẹẹbu ti o han lori ojula yii. Gbogbo awọn faili cache jẹ igba diẹ, ati pe eyikeyi ẹgbẹ kẹta ko ni wọle si wọn rara, ayafi bi o ṣe jẹ dandan lati gba atilẹyin imọ-ẹrọ lati ọdọ olutaja plug-in cache. Awọn faili cache pari ni aago ti oluṣakoso ojula ṣeto, ṣugbọn oluṣakoso le pa wọn rẹ\' ni irọrun ṣaaju akoko ipari wọn, ti o ba jẹ dandan. A le lo awọn iṣẹ QUIC.cloud lati ṣe ilana ati cache data rẹ fun igba diẹ.','Please see %s for more details.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ wo %s fún àwọn kúnkan mìíràn.','Learn More'=>'Kọ Ẹkọ Síi','Both full and partial strings can be used.'=>'A le lo àwọn okun gbogbo rẹ̀ àti apá kan wọn.','Both full URLs and partial strings can be used.'=>'Àwọn URL tó péye àti àwọn òrò tí kò péye ni a lè lò.','This setting will edit the .htaccess file.'=>'Ètò yìí yóò ṣàtúnṣe fáìlì .htaccess náà.','The queue is processed asynchronously. It may take time.'=>'A n ṣe iṣẹ lori atẹle naa ní àsiko kan náà. O le gba àkókò díẹ.','This feature needs an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin. The setting has no effect.'=>'Ẹ̀yà ara yìí nílò iṣẹ́ ìṣẹ̀dá lórí ẹ̀rọ ayélujára, èyí tí kò sí nínú àfikún yìí. Ètò náà kò ní ipa kankan.','You have used all of your daily quota for today.'=>'O ti lo gbogbo ipin ojoojumo rẹ fun oleoni.','Learn more or purchase additional quota.'=>'Kọ́ diẹ sii tabi ra ipin afikun.','You have used all of your quota left for current service this month.'=>'O ti lo gbogbo kuota rẹ ti o ku fun iṣẹ lọwọlọwọ ni oṣu yii.','You have too many requested images, please try again in a few minutes.'=>'O ní àwọn àwòrán tí o béèrè púpọ̀ jù, jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan si ní ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ sẹ́yìn.','You have images waiting to be pulled. Please wait for the automatic pull to complete, or pull them down manually now.'=>'O ni awọn aworan ti o n duro de fifa. Jọwọ duro ki fifa laifọwọyi le pari, tabi fa wọn silẹ pẹlu ọwọ ni bayi.','The image list is empty.'=>'Àtòkọ àwòrán náà ṣánṣán.','Not enough parameters. Please check if the QUIC.cloud connection is set correctly'=>'Àwọn àmì ìṣàfihàn kò tó. Jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò bóyá a ti ṣètò ìsopọ̀ QUIC.cloud náà lọ́nà tí ó tọ́','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet.'=>'Ìsé àtìmólẹ kan wa tí a kò tíì fa jáde.','There is proceeding queue not pulled yet. Queue info: %s.'=>'Àwọn ìlànà ìṣètò kan wà tí a kò tíì fà jáde. Ìsọ̀rọ̀ ìlànà ìṣètò: %s.','The site is not a valid alias on QUIC.cloud.'=>'Ojula isẹ yii kii ṣe aliasi to wulo lori QUIC.cloud.','The site is not registered on QUIC.cloud.'=>'A ko fi ojú sílẹ̀ ojú-wọ́ yìí sórí QUIC.cloud.','The QUIC.cloud connection is not correct. Please try to sync your QUIC.cloud connection again.'=>'Asopọ QUIC.cloud ko tọ. Jọwọ gbiyanju lati mu asopọ QUIC.cloud rẹ ṣiṣẹpọ lẹẹkan si.','The current server is under heavy load.'=>'Awọn sẹ́fà lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ wa labẹ ẹru nla.','Online node needs to be redetected.'=>'A ní láti tún wá àlejò orí ayélujára náà.','Credits are not enough to proceed the current request.'=>'Àwọn ìkírè kò tó láti tẹ̀ síwájú pẹ̀lú ìbéèrè yìí.','%s file not writable.'=>'%s kò lè kọ̀ sí fáìlì náà.','Could not find %1$s in %2$s.'=>'A le rí %1$s nínú %2$s.','Invalid login cookie. Please check the %s file.'=>'Kuki iwọle ti ko tọ. Jọwọ ṣayẹwo faili %s.','Failed to back up %s file, aborted changes.'=>'O kùn láti ṣe àfikún fún fáìlì %s, a ti fagilé àwọn àtúnṣe náà.','%s file not readable.'=>'%s kò lè kà fáìlì náà.','Failed to get %s file contents.'=>'Kiko lati gba awọn akoonu faili %s.','Failed to create table %1$s! SQL: %2$s.'=>'Kuna lati ṣẹda tabili %1$s! SQL: %2$s.','Crawler disabled by the server admin.'=>'Olùṣàkóso sífà ti mú ẹ̀rọ agbẹ̀wò kúrò lẹ́nu iṣẹ́.','Previous request too recent. Please try again later.'=>'Ìbéèrè tó kọjá tipọ̀jù. Jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i nígbà a mú.','Previous request too recent. Please try again after %s.'=>'Ìbéèrè rẹ tó kọjá ti pọ̀ jù. Jọ̀wọ́ tún gbiyanju lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i lẹ́yìn %s.','Your application is waiting for approval.'=>'Ohun elo rẹ n duro de ìfọwọ́sọ́pọ̀.','The callback validation to your domain failed due to hash mismatch.'=>'Ìfọwọ́sí àbọ̀padà sí agbègbè ayélujára rẹ kùnà nítorí àìbámu àmì bàmù (hash mismatch).','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers.'=>'Ìmúdájú ìpadàbọ̀ sí àgbègbè rẹ̀ (domain) kùnà. Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dájú pé kò sí ogiri iná (firewall) tí ó ń dí àwọn sẹ̀fà (servers) wa lọ́wọ́.','The callback validation to your domain failed. Please make sure there is no firewall blocking our servers. Response code: '=>'Ìfẹ́sí ìdájọ́ padà sí agbègbè rẹ náà kùnà. Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dajú pé kò sí àtòkọ aabo (firewall) tí ó ń dí àwọn sẹ̀fà wa lọ́wọ́. Koodu ìdáhùn:','Your domain has been forbidden from using our services due to a previous policy violation.'=>'A fi ìdí àìgbà ákọ̀ọ́ṣe rẹ lẹ́wọ̀n láti lo àwọn iṣẹ́ wa nítorí àṣìṣe ìlànà tẹ́lẹ̀.','You cannot remove this DNS zone, because it is still in use. Please update the domain\'s nameservers, then try to delete this zone again, otherwise your site will become inaccessible.'=>'O le ko agbegbe DNS yii kuro, nitori pe o tun n lo. Jọwọ sọ awọn orukọ nẹtiwọki ti ìwé oruko naa di tuntun, lẹhinna gbiyanju lati pa agbegbe yii kuro lẹẹkansi, bibẹẹkọ aaye rẹ yoo di aimọ.','Unknown error'=>'Àṣìṣe àìmọ̀','Filename is empty!'=>'Orúkọ fáìlì ṣofo!','Folder does not exist: %s'=>'Fáìlì kò sí: %s','Can not create folder: %1$s. Error: %2$s'=>'Ko le da folda: %1$s. Aṣiṣe: %2$s','Folder is not writable: %s.'=>'A kò lè kọ̀wé sínú fọ́ldà náà: %s.','File %s is not writable.'=>'Kò ṣe é kọ sí fáìlì %s.','Failed to write to %s.'=>'Kikọ si %s kuna.','Guest Mode lists synced successfully.'=>'Awọn akojọ Ìpò Àlejò ti wọpọ pẹ̀lú àṣeyọrí.','Failed to sync Guest Mode lists.'=>'Ikuna lati mu awọn atẹle ipo alejo ṣiṣẹpọ.','%1$s %2$s files left in queue'=>'Awọn faili %1$s %2$s ti o ku ninu ilana'