 the cache works in general, please test the cart.'=>'Lẹ́yìn pípátẹ́yọ́ pé kàṣì náà ń ṣiṣẹ́ ní gbogbo gbòògbò, jọ̀wọ́ dán pọtí ewé ẹrù wò.','To test the cart, visit the %sFAQ%s.'=>'Lati ṣe idanwo kẹkẹ naa, abẹwo si %sFAQ%s.','By default, the My Account, Checkout, and Cart pages are automatically excluded from caching. Misconfiguration of page associations in WooCommerce settings may cause some pages to be erroneously excluded.'=>'Nípa àìṣàtúnṣọ̀, àwọn ojúewé My Account, Checkout, and Cart ni a ti yọ kúrò nínú ìpamọ́ (caching) fúnra wọn. Àìtún ojúewé ṣe déédé nínú ètò WooCommerce lè fa kí a yọ àwọn ojúewé kan kúrò ní àìtọ́.','Product Update Interval'=>'Àkókò Ìsọfọ́n Ọjà Tuntun','Purge product on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Pa ọja kuro lori awọn ayipada si opoiye tabi ipo iṣura.','Purge categories only when stock status changes.'=>'Fi awọn ẹ̀ka kọ̀ sílẹ̀ nìkan nígbà tí ipò ọjà bá yípadà.','Purge product and categories only when the stock status changes.'=>'Ṣe ìwẹ̀ǹtọ́sí ọjà àti àwọn ẹ̀ka nìkan nígbà tí ipò ọjà bá yí padà.','Purge product only when the stock status changes.'=>'Pa ọja rẹ kuro nigbati ipo ọja ba yipada.','Do not purge categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Má ṣe pa àwọn ẹ̀ka rẹ́ nígbà tí ìwọ̀n tàbí ipò ọjà bá yí padà.','Always purge both product and categories on changes to the quantity or stock status.'=>'Nígbà gbogbo, ṣeàtúnṣe ọjà àti àwọn ẹ̀ka ọjà méjèèjì nígbà tí ìwọ̀n tàbí ipò ọjà bá yí padà.','Determines how changes in product quantity and product stock status affect product pages and their associated category pages.'=>'Ó parí bí àwọn àyípadà nínú iye ọjà àti ipò ìpamọ́ ọjà ṣe nípa lórí àwọn ojú ewé ọjà àti àwọn ojú ewé ẹ̀ka tí ó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú wọn.','Vary for Mini Cart'=>'Yipada fun Mini Kẹkẹ Ẹru','Generate a separate vary cache copy for the mini cart when the cart is not empty.'=>'Ṣẹda ẹ̀kọ́ cache iyipadaọtọ̀ lọtọ fun mini cart nigbati koki kò ṣofo.','If your theme does not use JS to update the mini cart, you must enable this option to display the correct cart contents.'=>'Tí àwọn àkòrí rẹ kò bá lò JS láti sọ kẹ̀kẹ́ ọjà kékeré di tuntun, o gbọ́dọ̀ mú àṣàyàn yìí ṣiṣẹ́ láti fi àwọn ohun inú kẹ̀kẹ́ ọjà náà hàn ní ọ̀nà tó tọ́.','New Developer Version Available!'=>'Ẹ̀yà Ìdàgbàsókè Tuntun Wà!','New developer version %s is available now.'=>'Ẹ̀dà alábòójútó tuntun %s ti wà nílẹ̀ báyìí.','Upgrade'=>'Ṣe agbega','Purge'=>'Pa kuro','Excludes'=>'Àwọn tí a yọ̀ kúrò','Object'=>'Ohun abemi','Browser'=>'Wọ́ṣàùṣù','Advanced'=>'Ilọsiwaju','Zinn® Cache Engine Network Cache Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Cache Network ti Zinn® Cache Engine','TTL'=>'TTL','ESI'=>'ESI','Zinn® Cache Engine Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ Ẹ̀rọ Ìpamọ́ Zinn®','NOTE'=>'Àkíyèsí','More settings available under %s menu'=>'Awọn eto miiran wa labẹ akojọ aṣayan %s','Advanced Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Tó Jinlẹ̀','Cache Control Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìdarí Cache','Network Enable Cache'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́ Ìpamọ́ Nẹ́twọ́kì Lọ́wọ́','Enabling Zinn® Cache Engine for WordPress here enables the cache for the network.'=>'Mimọ Zinn® Cache Engine fun WordPress nibi jẹ ki kaṣe ṣiṣẹ fun nẹtiwọọki naa.','It is STRONGLY recommended that the compatibility with other plugins on a single/few sites is tested first.'=>'A NI ÌMỌ̀RÀ GIDI pé kí o kọ́kọ́ dánu wò boya ó bá awọn afikun miiran mu lori aaye kan tabi awọn aaye diẹ.','This is to ensure compatibility prior to enabling the cache for all sites.'=>'Eyi ni lati rii daju pe ohun gbogbo baamu daradara ki o to mu ki kọṣi (cache) ṣiṣẹ fun gbogbo awọn aaye.','Exclude Settings'=>'Fi Ìtòsẹ ẹ̀gbẹ sílẹ̀','Purge Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìsọdọmọkọ̀tọ́','These settings are meant for ADVANCED USERS ONLY.'=>'Àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí jẹ́ fún ÀWỌN OLÙLÒ TÍ WỌN NI ỌGBỌ́ NI IPÒ GA NÌKÌKÌ.','Specify an AJAX action in POST/GET and the number of seconds to cache that request, separated by a space.'=>'Sọ ìgbésẹ̀ AJAX kan nínú POST/GET àti iye àwọn àáyá láti fi kóòdù ìpamọ́ ibéèrè yẹn pamọ́, tí ó ní ààyè kan láàárín wọn.','Enable this option if you are using both HTTP and HTTPS in the same domain and are noticing cache irregularities.'=>'Mú aṣàyàn yìí ṣiṣẹ́ tí o bá ń lò àti HTTP àti HTTPS ní agbègbè kan náà tí o sì ń kíyèsí àwọn àìṣédéede kásì.','When a visitor hovers over a page link, preload that page. This will speed up the visit to that link.'=>'Nígbà tí àlejò bá gbé eéṣì sórí ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ ojú-ewé kan, kó àkókọ́ ojú-ewé náà sínú ìrántí tẹ́lẹ̀. Èyí yóò yára mú ìbẹ̀wò sí ọ̀nà ìsopọ̀ yẹn.','This will generate extra requests to the server, which will increase server load.'=>'Eyi yoo ṣe agbejade awọn ibeere afikun si sẹ́fà (server), eyiti yoo mu ẹru sẹ́fà (server load) pọ si.','Use Network Admin Setting'=>'Lo Eto Alabojuto Nẹtiwọki','Please visit the %sInformation%s page on how to test the cache.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ bẹ̀ wò ojú-ewé %sÌsọ̀rọ̀%s lórí bí a ṣe ǹ dán ìpamọ́lẹ̀ wò.','NOTICE'=>'ÀKÍYÈSÌ','When disabling the cache, all cached entries for this site will be purged.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ń mú kaṣì kúrò, gbogbo àwọn ohun tí a fi pamọ́ fún ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí ni a óo parẹ́.','The network admin setting can be overridden here.'=>'Awon eto olutoju netiwọki le jẹ titọ si ni ibi.','Privately cache frontend pages for logged-in users. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Fipamọ awọn oju-iwe iwaju ni ikọkọ fun awọn olumulo ti o wọle. (LSWS %s nilo)','Privately cache commenters that have pending comments. Disabling this option will serve non-cacheable pages to commenters. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Fi àṣírí pamọ́ àwọn tó ń sọ̀rọ̀ tí wọ́n ní àwọn àlàyé tí wọ́n ń dúró de. Bí o bá mú àṣàyàn yìí kúrò, wọ́n á ṣe àwọn ojú ewé tí a kò lè fi àṣírí pamọ́ fún àwọn tó ń sọ̀rọ̀. (LSWS %s ni a nílò)','Cache requests made by WordPress REST API calls.'=>'Ṣe kaṣe awọn ibeere ti a ṣe nipasẹ awọn ipe WordPress REST API.','Disabling this option may negatively affect performance.'=>'Ìgbékalẹ̀ àṣàyàn yìí le ní ipa búburú lórí iṣẹ́ ìṣiṣẹ́ náà.','URI Paths containing these strings will NOT be cached as public.'=>'Awọn ọna URI ti o ni awọn okun wọnyi ninu KO NI fi pamọ gẹgẹ bi ti gbogbo eniyan.','Paths containing these strings will be cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Awọn ọna (paths) ti o ni awọn okun (strings) wọnyi ninu yoo wa ni ipamọ (cached) laisi kaakiri awọn eto ti ko le ni ipamọ (no-cacheable).','To define a custom TTL for a URI, add a space followed by the TTL value to the end of the URI.'=>'Lati ṣalaye TTL aṣa fun URI kan, fi àlàfo kàn tẹle e pẹlu iye TTL si opin URI naa.','For example, %1$s defines a TTL of %2$s seconds for %3$s.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ, %1$s ṣètò TTL ti %2$s àwọn ìṣẹ́jú ààyè fún %3$s.','Paths containing these strings will be forced to public cached regardless of no-cacheable settings.'=>'Awọn ọna (paths) ti o ni awọn okun wọnyi ninu yoo jẹ agbara lati ṣafipamọ si ita (public cached) laisi ka si awọn eto ti ko le ṣafipamọ (no-cacheable).','ESI Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹ̀ẹsẹ̀ ESI','With ESI (Edge Side Includes), pages may be served from cache for logged-in users.'=>'Pelú ESI (Edge Side Includes), a le fi ojú àwọn ojú-ewé ránṣẹ́ láti inú cache fún àwọn olùṣe-ìwọlé.','ESI allows you to designate parts of your dynamic page as separate fragments that are then assembled together to make the whole page. In other words, ESI lets you “punch holes” in a page, and then fill those holes with content that may be cached privately, cached publicly with its own TTL, or not cached at all.'=>'ESI jẹ ki o yan awọn apakan ti oju-iwe agbara rẹ gẹgẹbi awọn nkan lọtọ ti a n ṣajọpọ pọ lati ṣe oju-iwe naa lapapọ. Ni awọn ọrọ miiran, ESI jẹ ki o “lu awọn iho” ni oju-iwe kan, lẹhinna fọwọsi awọn iho wọnyẹn pẹlu akoonu ti o le ni ifipamọ ni ikọkọ, ti o ni ifipamọ gbangba pẹlu TTL tirẹ, tabi ti a ko ni ifipamọ rara.','WpW: Private Cache vs. Public Cache'=>'WpW: Ikọọ̀ṣẹ́ Ìpamọ́ Tẹ́ngà vs. Ikọọ̀ṣẹ́ Ìpamọ́ Gbangba','You can turn shortcodes into ESI blocks.'=>'O lè sọ àwọn àmì kúrú di àwọn àkójọ ESI.','Replace %1$s with %2$s.'=>'Rọ́pọ̀ %1$s pẹ̀lú %2$s.','ESI sample for developers'=>'Apẹẹrẹ ESI fun awọn olugbese','WARNING'=>'ÌKÌLỌ̀','These options are only available with LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.'=>'Àwọn aṣàyàn wọ̀nyí wà ní ìlérò nìkan pẹ̀lú LiteSpeed Enterprise Web Server.','Turn ON to cache public pages for logged in users, and serve the Admin Bar and Comment Form via ESI blocks. These two blocks will be uncached unless enabled below.'=>'Tan an lati fi pamọ (cache) awọn oju-iwe ti o gbangba fun awọn olumulo ti o wọle, ki o si pese Ọpa Alakoso (Admin Bar) ati Fọọmu Asọye nipasẹ awọn apakan ESI. Awọn apakan meji wọnyi kii yoo ni ipamọ ayafi ti o ba jẹ ki wọn ṣiṣẹ ni isalẹ.','Cache the built-in Admin Bar ESI block.'=>'Fi èsìkì àmúlùmì Admin Bar ESI tí a kọ tẹ́lẹ̀ sinu àkójọpọ̀ ìpamọ́ (cache).','Cache the built-in Comment Form ESI block.'=>'Fipamọ dínkọ bulọọki ESI Fọọmu Ìkọ̀gbọ̀ntín tí a ṣe sínú rẹ̀.','The list will be merged with the predefined nonces in your local data file.'=>'A o dapọ akojọ yẹn pọ mo awọn nonces ti a ti sọ tẹlẹ ninu faili data agbegbe rẹ.','The latest data file is'=>'Fáìlì dátà tó tuntun jẹ́','Filter %s is supported.'=>'A ṣe àtìlẹyìn fún àlẹmọ %s.','The above nonces will be converted to ESI automatically.'=>'Awọn nonces ti o wa loke yoo yipada sí ESI laifọwọyi.','An optional second parameter may be used to specify cache control. Use a space to separate'=>'A le lo paramita keji ti ko dandan lati sọ iṣakoso cache pato. Lo aaye kan lati yapa','Wildcard %1$s supported (match zero or more characters). For example, to match %2$s and %3$s, use %4$s.'=>'Àìsí ti àìpé %1$s ti ní ìlátìísé (ó baamu sí odò taabi ju ètò kan lo). Fún apèrẹ, láti baamu %2$s àti %3$s, lò %4$s.','If your site contains public content that certain user roles can see but other roles cannot, you can specify a Vary Group for those user roles. For example, specifying an administrator vary group allows there to be a separate publicly-cached page tailored to administrators (with “edit” links, etc), while all other user roles see the default public page.'=>'Tí ojú-wọ́ rẹ bá ní àwọn ohun àfikún tí àwọn ipa olùmọ̀lò kan lè rí tí àwọn òmíràn kò sì lè rí, o lè sọ Àwùjọ Vary kan pato fún àwọn ipa olùmọ̀lò wọ̀nyẹn. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, ṣíṣe àlàyé àwùjọ vary alṣàkóso jẹ́ kí ojú-ewé tí a ti kó pamọ́ sí gbangba sọtọ̀ wà tí ó bá àwọn aláṣàkóso mu (pẹlu àwọn àsopọ̀ “edit”, àti bẹ́ẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ), nígbà tí gbogbo àwọn ipa olùmọ̀lò yòókù rí ojú-ewé gbangba àìyípadà.','Paths containing these strings will not be cached.'=>'Awọn ọna (paths) ti o ni awọn okun wọnyi ninu kii yoo wa ni ipamọ (cached).','Predefined list will also be combined w/ the above settings'=>'Akojọ tí a ti ṣètò tẹ́lẹ̀ yóò tún darapọ̀ mọ́ àwọn ètò tó wà lókè yìí','Query strings containing these parameters will not be cached.'=>'Àwọn okùn ìbéèrè tí ó ní àwọn ìpìlẹ̀ wọ̀nyí kò ní jẹ́ kí wọ́n fipamọ́ sínú ibi ìpamọ́ ìgbà díẹ̀.','For example, for %1$s, %2$s and %3$s can be used here.'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ, fún %1$s, %2$s àti %3$s ni a lè lo níbí.','All categories are cached by default.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn ẹ̀ka ni a ti pamosí ní àiyipada.','To prevent %s from being cached, enter them here.'=>'Lati dènà kí a má ṣe fi %s pamọ́ sínú káṣì, tẹ́ ẹ̀ sí ibi yìí.','categories'=>'àwọn ẹ̀ka','If the category name is not found, the category will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Tí akọ́lẹ̀ ẹ̀ka kò bá hàn, a óo yọ ẹ̀ka náà kúrò nínú àkójọ nígbà tí a bá fipamọ́.','All tags are cached by default.'=>'Gbogbo àwọn tágì ni a ń kó pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìṣètò àkọ́kọ́.','tags'=>'àwọn àmì','If the tag slug is not found, the tag will be removed from the list on save.'=>'Tí a kò bá rí àmì ẹ̀dọ̀ (tag slug) náà, a óò yọ àmì ẹ̀dọ̀ náà kúrò nínú àkójọ náà nígbà tí a bá fi pamọ́.','To exclude %1$s, insert %2$s.'=>'Lati yọ %1$s kuro, fi %2$s sí i.','Selected roles will be excluded from cache.'=>'A o yọ awọn ipa ti a yan kuro ninu kaṣe (cache).','All pages'=>'Gbogbo oju-iwe','Front page'=>'Ojú ewé iwájú','Home page'=>'Ojú ìwé ilé','Pages'=>'Ojúewé','All pages with Recent Posts Widget'=>'Gbogbo awọn oju-iwe ti o ni Wigiiti Awọn Ifiranṣẹ Tuntun','Author archive'=>'Ibi ipamọ olùkọ̀wé','Post type archive'=>'Ilana irisi ifiweranṣẹ','Yearly archive'=>'Akọọlẹ ti ọdun kan','Monthly archive'=>'Ìṣẹ̀pẹ̀ oṣooṣù','Daily archive'=>'Àkọọlẹ ojoojúmọ́','Term archive (include category, tag, and tax)'=>'Ilé ìpamọ́ ọ̀rọ̀ (pẹlu ẹ̀ka, tàgì, ati tax)','Auto Purge Rules For Publish/Update'=>'Awọn Ìlànà Fifaragbé Fún Ìtẹ̀jáde/Ìsọfikún','Note'=>'Àkíyèsí','Select "All" if there are dynamic widgets linked to posts on pages other than the front or home pages.'=>'Yan "Gbogbo" ti awọn ohun elo agbara ba wa ti o ni asopọ si awọn ifiweranṣẹ lori awọn oju-iwe miiran yatọ si iwaju tabi awọn oju-iwe ile.','Other checkboxes will be ignored.'=>'A o foju fo awon apoti ayewo miiran.','Select only the archive types that are currently used, the others can be left unchecked.'=>'Yan awọn oriṣi aṣopọ nikan ti a nlo lọwọlọwọ, awọn miiran le jẹ ki a ko samisi wọn.','Select which pages will be automatically purged when posts are published/updated.'=>'Yan awọn oju-iwe ti a o sọ di mimọ laifọwọyi nigbati a ba tẹjade tabi ṣe imudojuiwọn awọn ifiweranṣẹ.','If ON, the stale copy of a cached page will be shown to visitors until a new cache copy is available. Reduces the server load for following visits. If OFF, the page will be dynamically generated while visitors wait.'=>'Tí ó bá wà nílẹ̀, a máa ń fi ẹ̀dà àtijọ́ ojú-ewé tí a kó pamọ́ hàn àwọn àlejò títí tí ẹ̀dà ìpamọ́ tuntun yóò fi wà. Ó ń dín ẹrù iṣẹ́ ìránṣẹ́ kù fún àwọn ìbẹ̀wò tí ń bọ̀. Tí kò bá wà nílẹ̀, a óò ṣe ojú-ewé náà nípa ìlànà agbára nígbà tí àwọn àlejò bá ń dúró.','By design, this option may serve stale content. Do not enable this option, if that is not OK with you.'=>'Nipasẹ apẹrẹ, aṣayan yii le sin akoonu ti o ti pẹ. Maṣe mu aṣayan yii ṣiṣẹ, ti iyẹn ko ba dara pẹlu rẹ.','The URLs here (one per line) will be purged automatically at the time set in the option "%s".'=>'Awọn URL nibi (ọkan fun laini kan) ni a o nu kuro laifọwọyi ni akoko ti a ṣeto ninu aṣayan "%s".','Both %1$s and %2$s are acceptable.'=>'Mejeeji %1$s ati %2$s jẹ́ itẹwọgba.','For URLs with wildcards, there may be a delay in initiating scheduled purge.'=>'Fún àwọn URL pẹ̀lú wildcard, ìdádúró le wà ní bíbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìṣẹ̀tọ́ tí a ṣètò fún ìparẹ́.','Specify the time to purge the "%s" list.'=>'Sọ akoko lati nu akojọ "%s" kuro.','Current server time is %s.'=>'Akoko olupin lọwọlọwọ ni %s.','A Purge All will be executed when WordPress runs these hooks.'=>'A Purge All yoo wà ní ṣíṣe nígbà tí WordPress bá ń ṣe àwọn hook wọ̀nyí.','Specify how long, in seconds, public pages are cached.'=>'Sọ bí pípẹ́ tó, ní ìṣẹ́jú àáyá, tí a ó fi pa ojú ìwé gbogbo ènìyàn mọ́ sínú ìkóòjọ.','Specify how long, in seconds, private pages are cached.'=>'Ṣọ tọ́ sí pípẹ́ tó, ní ìṣẹ́jú àáyá, tí a fi pamọ́ àwọn ojú ewé ìkọ̀kọ̀.','Specify how long, in seconds, the front page is cached.'=>'Ṣọ̀pọ̀ bí ìgbà wo, ní ìṣẹ́jú àáyá, ni a óo kó ojú ewé ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ pamọ́ sí.','Specify how long, in seconds, feeds are cached.'=>'Ṣọ̀tọ̀ bí àkókò tó, nínú àwọn ìṣẹ́jú àáyá, tí a fi ń pa àwọn ohun tí a fúnni mọ́.','If this is set to a number less than 30, feeds will not be cached.'=>'Tí a bá ṣètò èyí sí nọ́mbà tí o kéré sí 30, a kò ní fi pamọ́ àwọn ìfunni náà.','Specify how long, in seconds, REST calls are cached.'=>'Ṣọ tọ́ sí bí o ṣe pẹ́ tó, ní àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, tí a fi ń pamọ́ àwọn ìpè REST.','Specify an HTTP status code and the number of seconds to cache that page, separated by a space.'=>'Sọ àmì ipò HTTP kan àti iye àwọn àlẹ̀kùn fún àkókò tí o fẹ́ kí ojú ewé yẹn dúró nínú àkójọ ìpamọ́, kí o sì fi àyè sí àárín wọn.','Browser Cache Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ibi Pamọ́ Àṣà Aṣàwákiri','OpenLiteSpeed users please check this'=>'Àwọn olùṣlẹ́ OpenLiteSpeed jọ̀wọ́ kí wọ́n ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','Setting Up Custom Headers'=>'Ṣíṣètò Àwọn Àkọlé Àṣàyàn','Browser caching stores static files locally in the user\'s browser. Turn on this setting to reduce repeated requests for static files.'=>'Akójọpọ ìpamọ̀ aṣàwákiri (browser caching) máa n tọ́jú àwọn fáìlì tí kò yí padà sí agbègbè nínú aṣàwákiri olùlò náà. Tan ètò yìí mọ́n láti dín àwọn ìbéèrè léraléra fún àwọn fáìlì tí kò yí padà kù.','You can turn on browser caching in server admin too. %sLearn more about LiteSpeed browser cache settings%s.'=>'O le tan ipamọ aṣàwákiri silẹ ninu abojuto sẹ́fà pẹlu. %sKọ diẹ sii nipa awọn eto ipamọ aṣàwákiri LiteSpeed%s.','The amount of time, in seconds, that files will be stored in browser cache before expiring.'=>'Ìwọ̀n àkókò, ní àwọn ìṣẹ́jú àáyá, tí a óò fi tọ́jú àwọn fáìlì sínú àlámọ̀ ìwọ̀ṣẹ̀ (browser cache) kí wọ́n tó parí àkókò wọn.','Ignore certain query strings when caching. (LSWS %s required)'=>'Fojú ragada kọ àwọn okùn ìbéèrè kan nígbà tí o bá ń pa á mọ́ sí ibi ìpamọ́. (LSWS %s ni a nílò)','For example, to drop parameters beginning with %1$s, %2$s can be used here.'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ, láti sọ àwọn paramítà tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lu %1$s silẹ, a lè lo %2$s níbí.','Serve a separate cache copy for mobile visitors.'=>'Fi ẹ̀kọ́ ìpamọ́ ọtọ̀ ranṣẹ fún àwọn alábèbẹ tó ń lo ẹ̀rọ alágbèéká.','Learn more about when this is needed'=>'Kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́ sí i nípa ìgbà tí èyí ṣe pàtàkì','Htaccess did not match configuration option.'=>'Htaccess kò bá aṣayan iṣeto mu.','Htaccess rule is: %s'=>'Ofin Htaccess ni: %s','If %1$s is %2$s, then %3$s must be populated!'=>'Tí %1$s bá jẹ́ %2$s, nígbà náà a ní láti kún %3$s!','cookies'=>'Àwọn kuki','user agents'=>'àwọn aṣojú olùmọ̀','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive. MUST BE UNIQUE FROM OTHER WEB APPLICATIONS.'=>'ÌLÀN: àwọn lẹ́tà, nọ́mbà ati "_". Kò sí àlàfo, wọ́n sì sinmi lórí irú lẹ́tà (títóbi tàbí kékeré). GBUGBD JÉ ÀÌLẸGBẸ́ LÁTI ARA ÀWỌN OHUN ELO WẸ́BÙ MÍRÀN.','The default login cookie is %s.'=>'Kuki ìwọlé àiyipada jẹ %s.','The server will determine if the user is logged in based on the existence of this cookie.'=>'Olupese naa yoo pinnu boya olumulo ti wọle da lori wiwa kuki yii.','This setting is useful for those that have multiple web applications for the same domain.'=>'Ètò yìí wúlò fún àwọn tí wọ́n ní ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ohun èlò wẹ́bù fún domain kan náà.','If every web application uses the same cookie, the server may confuse whether a user is logged in or not.'=>'Tí gbogbo ohun elo wẹ́bù bá lo kuki kan náà, sẹ́fà náà le rù ú mọ́ bí olumulo kan ti wọlé tàbí kò tíì wọlé.','The cookie set here will be used for this WordPress installation.'=>'Kuki ti a ṣeto nibi yoo jẹ lilo fun fifi sori ẹrọ WordPress yii.','Example use case:'=>'Àpẹẹrẹ lílò:','There is a WordPress installed for %s.'=>'A fi WordPress sori %s.','Then another WordPress is installed (NOT MULTISITE) at %s'=>'Nigbana ni a fi WordPress miiran sori (KỌ NI MULTISITE) ni %s','The cache needs to distinguish who is logged into which WordPress site in order to cache correctly.'=>'Ìkóòòró náà nílò láti mọ ẹni tí ó wọ ilé iṣẹ́ ẹ̀rọ ayélujára WordPress wo kí ó lè kóòòró dáadáa.','Invalid login cookie. Invalid characters found.'=>'Kuki ìwọlé tí kò tọ́. A rí àwọn lẹ́tà tàbí àmì tí kò tọ́.','WARNING: The .htaccess login cookie and Database login cookie do not match.'=>'IKILO: Kuki wiwọle .htaccess ati kuki wiwọle Database ko baramu.','SYNTAX: alphanumeric and "_". No spaces and case sensitive.'=>'ÌLÀN: àwọn lẹ́tà, nọ́mbà àti "_". Kò sí àlàfo àti pé lẹ́tà ńlá tàbí kékeré ṣe pàtàkì.','You can list the 3rd party vary cookies here.'=>'O le ṣe àkọsílẹ àwọn kuki ẹ̀gbẹ kẹta ti o yí padà síhìn-ín.','Enabled'=>'Ti a fi agbara ṣiṣẹ','Disabled'=>'Ti a ṣe ni ailagbara','Not Available'=>'Ko si','Passed'=>'Ti kọja','Failed'=>'Kòṣeéṣe','Object Cache Settings'=>'Ètò Ìpamọ́ Ohun Élò','Use external object cache functionality.'=>'Lo iṣẹ́ ibi ipamọ nkan ita.','Status'=>'Ipo','%s Extension'=>'Ìgbòòkùn %s','Connection Test'=>'Ìdánwò Àsopọ̀','Your %s Hostname or IP address.'=>'Orúkọ Alábùkún %s tabi àdírẹ́sì IP rẹ.','If you are using a %1$s socket, %2$s should be set to %3$s'=>'Tí o bá nlo bọ́ọ̀lù ìsopọ̀ %1$s, ó yẹ kí a ṣètò %2$s sí %3$s','Default port for %1$s is %2$s.'=>'Ibudo aiyipada fun %1$s jẹ %2$s.','Default TTL for cached objects.'=>'TTL àiyọ̀ṣe fún àwọn ohun tí a kó pamọ́ sí ìpamọ́.','Only available when %s is installed.'=>'Nikan wa nígbà tí a bá fi %s sori ẹrọ.','Specify the password used when connecting.'=>'Sọ ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà tí a lò nígbà tí o ń sopọ̀.','Database to be used'=>'Data base ti a o lo','Groups cached at the network level.'=>'Àwọn ẹgbẹ́ tí a pẹ̀lú pamọ́ ní ipele ẹ̀rọ ayélujára.','Use keep-alive connections to speed up cache operations.'=>'Lo awọn asopọ keep-alive lati yara awọn iṣẹ ifipamọ (cache) gẹgẹ bi kiakia.','Improve wp-admin speed through caching. (May encounter expired data)'=>'Mu iyara wp-admin dara si i nipa lilo fifipamọ (caching). (O le pade data ti o ti pari akoko rẹ)','When enabled, the cache will automatically purge when any plugin, theme or the WordPress core is upgraded.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá mú un ṣiṣẹ́, cache yóò paá rẹ́ fúnrarẹ̀ nígbà tí a bá ṣe ìgbékalẹ̀ èyíkéyìí fún plugin, theme tàbí WordPress core.','Cloudflare Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Cloudflare','Use %s API functionality.'=>'Lo iṣẹ app API %s.','Global API Key / API Token'=>'Bọtọni API Agbaye / Àmì API','Your API key / token is used to access %s APIs.'=>'A bọ́tìnì / tọ́kẹ̀ní API rẹ ni a ń lò láti wọ inú àwọn API %s.','Get it from %s.'=>'Gba a láti %s.','Recommended to generate the token from Cloudflare API token template "WordPress".'=>'A gbọdọ lati dá tɔ́kìnù náà jade láti inú àwoṣe tɔ́kìnù Cloudflare API "WordPress".','Email Address'=>'Adirẹsi Īmeeli','Your Email address on %s.'=>'Adirẹsi imeeli rẹ lori %s.','Optional when API token used.'=>'Kò pọn dandan nígbà tí a bá lò àmì ìṣàpẹẹrẹ API.','Domain'=>'Agbegbe ayelujara','You can just type part of the domain.'=>'O le kan tẹ apakan agbegbe naa.','Once saved, it will be matched with the current list and completed automatically.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá fi pamọ́, a óò fi wé àtòjọ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yóò sì parí fún un rẹ̀ fúnrarẹ̀.','Clear %s cache when "Purge All" is run.'=>'Ko cache %s kuro nigbati a ba nṣiṣẹ "Purge All".','To enable the following functionality, turn ON Cloudflare API in CDN Settings.'=>'Lati jẹ ki iṣẹ yii ṣiṣẹ, tan Cloudflare API sori ninu Awọn Eto CDN.','Cloudflare Domain'=>'Agbegbe Cloudflare','Cloudflare Zone'=>'Agbègbè Cloudflare','Development Mode'=>'Ipò Ìgbòkègbodò Ìdagbasègbé','Turn ON'=>'Tan TẸ','Turn OFF'=>'Paapaa','Check Status'=>'Ṣayẹwo Ipò','Current status is %1$s since %2$s.'=>'Ipò lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ jẹ́ %1$s láti %2$s wá.','Current status is %s.'=>'Ipò lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ jẹ́ %s.','Development mode will be automatically turned off in %s.'=>'A o pa ipo ìdàgbàsókè tì fún un ní pàǹtíní nínú %s.','Temporarily bypass Cloudflare cache. This allows changes to the origin server to be seen in realtime.'=>'Fi Cloudflare cache pamọ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀. Èyí jẹ́ kí àwọn àtúnṣe sí ìpìlẹ̀ sẹ́fà (origin server) hàn lẹ́sẹ̀kẹsẹ̀.','Development Mode will be turned off automatically after three hours.'=>'A o Pa ipo Ìgbòkègbodò Ìdàgbàsókè ré lẹ́yìn wákàtí mẹ́ta fún ara rẹ̀.','%1$sLearn More%2$s'=>'%1$sKọ́ Ẹ̀kọ́ Síi%2$s','Cloudflare Cache'=>'Ikojọpọ Cloudflare','Purge Everything'=>'Pa Ohun Gbogbo Rẹ Kuro','Other Static CDN'=>'CDN Tí Kò Yípadà Míràn','Zinn® Cache Engine CDN'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine CDN','CDN Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò CDN','Turn this setting %s if you are using a traditional Content Delivery Network (CDN) or a subdomain for static content.'=>'Yi eto yìí sí %s bí o bá ń lo Network Ifijiṣẹ Akoonu (CDN) ibile tabi subdomain kan fun akoonu aimọṣepọ.','NOTE: Cloudflare does not use CDN Mapping. If you are only using Cloudflare, leave this setting %s.'=>'ÀKÍYÈSÍ: Cloudflare kò lo CDN Mapping. Tí o bá ń lo Cloudflare nìkan, fi ètò yìí sílẹ̀ bí %s.','To randomize CDN hostname, define multiple hostnames for the same resources.'=>'Lati sọ orukọ agbalejo CDN di àìmọ̀, ṣètọ̀ ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ orukọ agbalejo fún àwọn ohun àmúlò kan náà.','Serve all image files through the CDN. This will affect all attachments, HTML %1$s tags, and CSS %2$s attributes.'=>'Fi gbogbo awọn faili aw ചിത്ര meji ranṣẹ nipasẹ CDN. Eyi yoo kan gbogbo awọn asomọ, awọn taagi HTML %1$s, ati awọn abuda CSS %2$s.','Serve all CSS files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP CSS files.'=>'Fi gbogbo awọn faili CSS ranṣẹ nipasẹ CDN. Eyi yoo kan gbogbo awọn faili WP CSS ti a ti fi si ilana.','Serve all JavaScript files through the CDN. This will affect all enqueued WP JavaScript files.'=>'Fi CDN ran gbogbo awọn faili JavaScript. Eyi yoo ni ipa lori gbogbo awọn faili JavaScript WP ti a fi sinu ilana.','Static file type links to be replaced by CDN links.'=>'Awọn ọna asopọ iru faili aimi lati rọpo nipasẹ awọn ọna asopọ CDN.','This will affect all tags containing attributes: %s.'=>'Èyí yóò ní ipa lórí gbogbo àwọn tágì tí ó ní àwọn àbùdá: %s.','If you turn any of the above settings OFF, please remove the related file types from the %s box.'=>'Tí o bá pa èyíkéyìí nínú awọn ètò tí ó wà lókè yìí KỌ́Ọ̀SÌ, jọ̀wọ́ yọ awọn irúfẹ́ fáìlì tí ó jọmọ́ kúrò nínú àpótí %s.','Specify which HTML element attributes will be replaced with CDN Mapping.'=>'Ṣọ alaye lori iru awọn ànímọ́ element HTML wo ni a o fi CDN Mapping rọpo.','Only attributes listed here will be replaced.'=>'Àwọn ànímọ́ nìkan tí a ṣe àkọsílẹ̀ wọn níbí ni a óò rọ́pò.','Use the format %1$s or %2$s (element is optional).'=>'Lo ọna kika %1$s tabi %2$s (eroja jẹa aṣayan).','Site URL to be served through the CDN. Beginning with %1$s. For example, %2$s.'=>'URL aaye ti a o fi CDN ranṣẹ. Bẹrẹ pẹlu %1$s. Fun apẹẹrẹ, %2$s.','Only files within these directories will be pointed to the CDN.'=>'Awọn faili nikan ti o wa laarin awọn ilana wọnyi ni ao tọka si CDN.','Paths containing these strings will not be served from the CDN.'=>'Awọn ọna ti o ni awọn okun wọnyi ninu kii yoo jẹ iṣẹ lati CDN.','Are you sure to delete all existing blocklist items?'=>'Ṣe o ni idaniloju lati pa gbogbo awọn ohun kan ti o wa ninu àkọsọ kuro?','Empty blocklist'=>'Ṣofo àkójọ àwọn tí a dènà','Blocklist'=>'Àkójọ àwọn tí a dènà','Total'=>'Apapọ','URL'=>'URL','Operation'=>'Iṣẹ́','Remove from Blocklist'=>'Yọ kuro ninu atọka ti a dènà','API: PHP Constant %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: PHP Constant %s wà láti mú blocklist kúrò.','API: Filter %s available to disable blocklist.'=>'API: Ajọ %s wà fún pipa blocklist rẹ.','Not blocklisted'=>'Kò sí nínú àkójọ àwọn tí a dènà','Blocklisted due to not cacheable'=>'Wọn ti dínkùn lẹ́yìn tí kò ṣeé fi pamọ́ sínú ìkóòto (cache)','Blocklisted'=>'A fi si ibi ti a ti dènà','Summary'=>'Akọṣile','Map'=>'Ya si','Zinn® Cache Engine Crawler'=>'Ẹ́ńjìnnì Skannu Àkójọ-pamọ́ Zinn®','Clean Crawler Map'=>'Màpù Aṣẹ̀dá Tó Mọ́','Refresh Crawler Map'=>'Sọ àwọn àwòrán abánidọ̀wò pọ̀ tàbí tún bẹ̀rẹ̀ rẹ̀','Generated at %s'=>'A da si %s','Sitemap List'=>'Àkójọàpọ̀ ojú-wẹ̀bù','Sitemap Total'=>'Àpapọ̀ Sitemap','URL Search'=>'Àárín Ìwárìrì URL','Cache Hit'=>'Àbájáde Ìpamọ́','Cache Miss'=>'Àìrí Kóèṣ̣ì','Crawler Status'=>'Ipò ẹ̀rọ àwárí ayélujára','Add to Blocklist'=>'Fi kun àkójọ àwọn tí a dènà','Crawler General Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Àpapọ̀ fún Crawler','This will enable crawler cron.'=>'Èyí yóò mú kí cron alágbàárà ṣiṣẹ́.','Specify how long in seconds before the crawler should initiate crawling the entire sitemap again.'=>'Sọ àkókò ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí o yẹ kí olùwákiri náà bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í wákiri gbogbo sitemap náà lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','The crawler will use your XML sitemap or sitemap index. Enter the full URL to your sitemap here.'=>'Olùkálẹ̀ (crawler) náà yóò lo maapu aaye XML rẹ tabi atọka maapu aaye. Tẹ URL kikun si maapu aaye rẹ si ibi.','The maximum average server load allowed while crawling. The number of crawler threads in use will be actively reduced until average server load falls under this limit. If this cannot be achieved with a single thread, the current crawler run will be terminated.'=>'Ìwọ̀n àpíníjọ àgbíjù sérvà tó ga jù lọ tí a gbà đè nígbà tí a ń wá kiri. A ó dín iye àwọn tírèdì kírólà tí a ń lò kù títí tí àpíníjọ àgbíjù sérvà yóò fi sọ̀kalẹ̀ sí abẹ́ àlà yìí. Bí èyí kò bá ṣe é ṣe pẹ̀lú tírèdì kan ṣoṣo, a ó dá iṣẹ́ kírólà tó ń lọ lọ́wọ́ dúró.','Server enforced value: %s'=>'Iye tí ẹ̀rọ alábòójútó fi mú aṣẹ: %s','Server allowed max value: %s'=>'Iye ti o pọ julọ ti a gba laaye fun sẹfà: %s','To crawl the site as a logged-in user, enter the user ids to be simulated.'=>'Lati ka aaye naa gẹgẹbi olumulo tiwọle, tẹ awọn ID olumulo sii lati ṣe imito.','You must set %s before using this feature.'=>'O gbọdọ ṣeto %s ki o to lo ẹya ara ẹrọ yii.','Click here to set.'=>'Tẹ ibi lati ṣeto.','You must set %1$s to %2$s before using this feature.'=>'O gbọdọ ṣeto %1$s sí %2$s kí o tó lo ẹ̀ya ara yìí.','To crawl for a particular cookie, enter the cookie name, and the values you wish to crawl for. Values should be one per line. There will be one crawler created per cookie value, per simulated role.'=>'Lati ṣe àwárí fún kuki kan pato, tẹ orúkọ kuki naa sii, ati awọn iye ti o fẹ lati wa fun. Awọn iye yẹ ki o jẹ ọkan fun laini kan. A o ṣẹda aṣàwárí kan fun iye kuki kọọkan, fun ipa ti a fara wé kọọkan.','Use %1$s in %2$s to indicate this cookie has not been set.'=>'Lo %1$s ninu %2$s lati fi han pe a ko tii ṣeto kuki yii.','You need to set the %s in Settings first before using the crawler'=>'O ni lati kọ́kọ́ ṣeto %s ninu Ètò (Settings) ṣaaju ki o to lo olùrakọ (crawler)','Crawler Cron'=>'Crawler Cron','The crawler feature is not enabled on the LiteSpeed server. Please consult your server admin or hosting provider.'=>'Àbújà crawler kò sÍ ní agbára lórí èèrò-ìbánilèrò LiteSpeed. J̀lú kan si ìwàkíwà èèrò-ìbánilèrò rè kà bí olùfúni ti ìbúkà rè.','See %sIntroduction for Enabling the Crawler%s for detailed information.'=>'Wo %sIntroduction for Enabling%s fún àlàyé kíkún.','Current sitemap crawl started at'=>'Ìgbésẹ̀ wẹ̀wẹ̀ sitemap lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní','The next complete sitemap crawl will start at'=>'Ìpadà bọ̀ lọ sùwùn sitemap tó kàn yóò bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní','Last complete run time for all crawlers'=>'Àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ tí ó pé gbororo kẹ́yìn fún gbogbo àwọn aláwùúrọ̀','%d seconds'=>'%d ìṣẹ́jú ààyá','Run time for previous crawler'=>'Àkókò ìṣiṣẹ́ fún olùwárí tí ó kọjá','Current crawler started at'=>'Olùṣẹ̀wádìí lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní','Current server load'=>'Ẹru àwọn sẹ́fà lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́','Last interval'=>'Àkókò tó kọjá','Ended reason'=>'Idi ti o pari','Last crawled'=>'Ìgbà tí a ṣe àyẹ̀wò kẹ́yìn','%d item(s)'=>'Ohun (àwọn ohun) %d','Reset position'=>'Tún ipò náà ṣe','Manually run'=>'Ṣiṣẹ pẹlu ọwọ','Cron Name'=>'Oruko Cron','Run Frequency'=>'Ìgbà ìṣiṣẹ́','Activate'=>'Mú Ṣiṣẹ','Running'=>'Ńṣeéṣẹ́','Waiting'=>'N dúró','Hit'=>'Lu','Miss'=>'Padanu','Position: '=>'Ipo:','running'=>'nṣe lẹ́kọ̀ọ́','Waiting to be Crawled'=>'Nduro lati jẹ́ kika (Crawled)','Already Cached'=>'Ti kó Pamọ́ tẹ́lẹ̀','Successfully Crawled'=>'Wọ́n ti lọ́wọ́ wọ̀ ọ́ yọrí sí rere','Run frequency is set by the Interval Between Runs setting.'=>'Awon igbohunsefẹfẹ ṣiṣe ni a nṣeto nipasẹ eto Aaye Laarin Awọn Ṣiṣe.','Crawlers cannot run concurrently. If both the cron and a manual run start at similar times, the first to be started will take precedence.'=>'Awọn olùwákiri kò lè ṣiṣẹ́ ní àkókò kan náà. Bí cron àti ìṣiṣẹ́ ọwọ́ bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ ní àkókò tó jọra, èkínní tí a bá bẹ̀rẹ̀ ni yóò jẹ́ àkọ́kọ́.','Please see %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s to learn how to create the system cron task.'=>'Jọ̀ọ́ wo %sHooking WP-Cron Into the System Task Scheduler%s láti kọ́ bí a ṣe ń ṣẹ̀dá iṣẹ́ cron ètò náà.','Watch Crawler Status'=>'Wo ipo Crawler','Show crawler status'=>'Fi ipo olùpẹ̀wà hàn','Start watching...'=>'Bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í wò...','No crawler meta file generated yet'=>'Àì ti ṣe àב́èdá dòkùmíntì fún olùwárí kankan sí iṣẹ́ kankan báyìí','Cache Status'=>'Ipo Cache','More'=>'Elomi','Public Cache'=>'Ìkójọpọ̀ Gbangba','Private Cache'=>'Ikọ Mọni Ikọọlu Ti Ara Ẹni','Crawler(s)'=>'Olùwákiri (Àwọn Olùwákiri)','Currently active crawler'=>'Olùṣàyẹ̀wò tó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́ báyìí','%1$s %2$d item(s)'=>'%1$s %2$d nkan (awọn)','Last crawled:'=>'Ìgbà ìkẹyìn tí a lọ wò ó:','News'=>'Àwọn ìròyìn','Network Dashboard'=>'Ojútù Kọ́ǹpútà Nẹ́twọ́kì','Zinn® Cache Engine Dashboard'=>'Ojú déki Zinn® Cache Engine','Usage Statistics: %s'=>'Àwọn Ìsọfọ̀ Lílò: %s','CDN Bandwidth'=>'Lọ́ọ̀dù Ààyè CDN','Low Quality Image Placeholder'=>'Ààyè Àwòrán Tó Kéré Báùn','Fast Queue Usage'=>'Lilo Ila ti O Yara Mo','Usage'=>'Lilo','Pay as You Go'=>'San bi o ti n lo','PAYG Balance'=>'Ìwọ̀n Owó PAYG','This Month Usage: %s'=>'Lilo Oṣu yii: %s','Pay as You Go Usage Statistics'=>'Àwọn ìwọ̀n ìlò San Gẹ́gẹ́ Bí O Ṣe Ń Lò Wọ́n','Total Usage'=>'Àpapọ̀ Ìlò','Total images optimized in this month'=>'Àwọn àwòrán tí a mú dára jù lọ ní oṣù yìí','DB Optimization Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìṣèlọ́ Dàbàsì','Zinn® Cache Engine Database Optimization'=>'Ìṣètò Ìpamọ́ Data Engine ti Zinn® Cache','Clean All'=>'Nu gbogbo rẹ kuro','Post Revisions'=>'Àwọn Àtúnyẹ̀wò Ifọ̀rọ̀ránṣẹ́','Clean all post revisions'=>'Pa gbogbo àtúnṣe ìfiránṣẹ́ rẹ kúrò','Orphaned Post Meta'=>'Meta Ifẹnọn tí Ó Sọnu','Clean all orphaned post meta records'=>'Nu gbogbo awọn akọsilẹ post meta ti o sọnu tabi ti o ku si silẹ','Auto Drafts'=>'Àwọn Akọpamọ Àìníṣẹ́sí','Clean all auto saved drafts'=>'Pa gbogbo àwọn àkọpamọ ti a fi ẹ̀rọ pamọ́ kúrò','Trashed Posts'=>'Àwọnfín tí a sọ nù','Clean all trashed posts and pages'=>'Nu gbogbo awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn oju-iwe ti o wa ninu idọti kuro','Spam Comments'=>'Àwọn Ọ̀rọ̀ Ìsọ̀sọ́ tí kò wúlè','Clean all spam comments'=>'Nu gbogbo àwọn àlàyé àìmọ́ kúrò','Trashed Comments'=>'Àwọn Àlàyé tí a Sọ nù','Clean all trashed comments'=>'Nu gbogbo awọn asọye ti a sọ nu bi idọti','Trackbacks/Pingbacks'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́kasí ẹ̀yìn / Àwọn ìfitónílétí pingback','Clean all trackbacks and pingbacks'=>'Pa gbogbo àwọn ìtọ́kasí àti àwọn pingback kúrò','Expired Transients'=>'Àwọn ohun tí ó ti parí àkókò','Clean expired transient options'=>'Pa awọn aṣayan igba diẹ ti o ti kọja kuro','All Transients'=>'Gbogbo Transients','Clean all transient options'=>'Pa gbogbo àwọn àṣàyàn kíkọjá kúrò','Optimize Tables'=>'Mú àwọn tábìlì dára síi','Optimize all tables in your database'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe gbogbo tabili ninu apoti data rẹ','Clean revisions older than %1$s day(s), excluding %2$s latest revisions'=>'Pa awọn atunyẹwo ti o ti pe ju ọjọ %1$s lọ, ti a yọ awọn atunyẹwo tuntun %2$s kuro','Database Optimizer'=>'Olùṣàtúnṣe Ilé Ìpamọ́ Tàbí Dátàbèéṣì','Database Table Engine Converter'=>'Olùyípadà Ẹ̀rọ Tábìlì Ìpínlẹ̀ Data','Table'=>'Tábìlì','Engine'=>'Ẹrọ','Tool'=>'Ọ̀rọ̀','Convert to InnoDB'=>'Yi pada si InnoDB','We are good. No table uses MyISAM engine.'=>'Awa dara. Ko si tabili ti o nlo engine MyISAM.','Database Summary'=>'Àkótán Ilé Ìpamọ́ Títún','Autoload size'=>'Iwọn ikojọpọ adaṣe','Autoload entries'=>'Àwọn ohun ìgbékalẹ̀ àti-kún','Autoload top list'=>'Àwọn tó ga jù lọ fún ìkójọ àǹfààní','Option Name'=>'Oruko Aṣayan','Autoload'=>'Fún ọkọ̀ awọ̀tẹ́lẹ̀','Size'=>'Iwọn','Specify the number of most recent revisions to keep when cleaning revisions.'=>'Sọ nọmba awọn Atunyẹwo to se tuntun julọ lati tọju nigbati o ba n sọ awọn atunyẹwo di mimọ.','Day(s)'=>'Ọjọ́ (Àwọn)','Revisions newer than this many days will be kept when cleaning revisions.'=>'Awon atunyewo ti o tun to ju ojo wonyi yoo ni iduro si oju deede nigbati a ba n sọ atunyewo di mimọ.','Public'=>'Gbangba','Private'=>'Adashe','Disable'=>'Mu kuro','Widget Cache TTL'=>'Agbára Cache ti Widget TTL','Recommended value: 28800 seconds (8 hours).'=>'Iye ti a n ṣe iṣeduro: abajade aaya 28800 (awọn wakati 8).','A TTL of 0 indicates do not cache.'=>'Ìwọ̀n TTL tí ó jẹ́ 0 fi hàn pé kí a má ṣe fi pamọ́ sínú ìkójọpọ̀ ìpamọ́.','General Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Àpapọ̀','Zinn® Cache Engine General Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ fún Zinn® Cache Engine','Use Primary Site Configuration'=>'Lo Ìtòsẹẹṣẹ Ààyè Àkọ́kọ́','Check this option to use the primary site\'s configuration for all subsites.'=>'Ṣayẹọ aṣayan yii lati lo iṣeto aaye akọkọ fun gbogbo awọn aaye kekere.','This will disable the settings page on all subsites.'=>'Èyí yóò mú ojúewé ètò kúrò lórí gbogbo àwọn ojúewé abẹ́.','This option enables maximum optimization for Guest Mode visitors.'=>'Aṣayan yii n mu iṣapejuwe pọ si fun awọn oluwo ni Ipo Alejo.','Please read all warnings before enabling this option.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ ka gbogbo ìkìlọ̀ kí o tó sọ àṣàyàn yìí di ṣiṣẹ́.','Notice'=>'Àkíyèsí','%s must be turned ON for this setting to work.'=>'%s gbọdọ wa ni titan kí ètò yìí lè ṣiṣẹ́.','You need to turn %s on to get maximum result.'=>'O nílò láti tan %s láti gba èso tó pọ̀ jù lọ.','You need to turn %s on and finish all WebP generation to get maximum result.'=>'O ní láti tan %s kí o sì parí gbogbo ìṣẹ̀dá WebP láti gba èsì tó pọ̀ jù lọ.','Enter this site\'s IP address to allow cloud services directly call IP instead of domain name. This eliminates the overhead of DNS and CDN lookups.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi IP aaye yii lati jẹ ki awọn iṣẹ awọsanma pe IP taara dipo orukọ agbegbe naa. Eyi n yọkuro iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti DNS ati awọn wiwa CDN.','Your server IP'=>'IP sèva rẹ','Check my public IP from'=>'Ṣayẹwo IP gbangba mi lati','the auto-detected IP may not be accurate if you have an additional outgoing IP set, or you have multiple IPs configured on your server.'=>'IP ti a ri laifọwọyi le ma pe ti o ba ni IP miiran ti o jade ti a ṣeto, tabi ti o ni awọn IP pupọ ti a tunṣe sori sẹ́fà rẹ.','Please make sure this IP is the correct one for visiting your site.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ rí i dájú pé IP yìí ni èyí tí ó tọ́ fún lílọ sí ojú òpó wẹ́bù rẹ.','Turn this option ON to show latest news automatically, including hotfixes, new releases, available beta versions, and promotions.'=>'Tan aṣayan yii ON lati fi awọn iroyin tuntun han laifọwọyi, pẹlu awọn atunṣe gbigbona, awọn igbasilẹ tuntun, awọn ẹya beta ti o wa, ati awọn igbega.','Turn this option ON to have Zinn® Cache Engine updated automatically, whenever a new version is released. If OFF, update manually as usual.'=>'Tan aṣayan yii ON lati jẹ ki Zinn® Cache Engine di mimojuto laifọwọyi, nigbakugba ti  tuntun kan ba jade. Ti o ba wa ni OFF, ṣe imudojuiwọn pẹlu ọwọ bi o ṣe yẹ.','Guest Mode provides an always cacheable landing page for an automated guest\'s first time visit, and then attempts to update cache varies via AJAX.'=>'Ipo Alejo n pese oju-iwe abọ ti a lefi pamọ nigbagbogbo fun abẹwo akọkọ alejo ti a ṣe laifọwọyi, lẹhinna o n gbiyanju lati ṣe imudojuiwọn ibi ti omiiran ti pamọ nipasẹ AJAX.','This option can help to correct the cache vary for certain advanced mobile or tablet visitors.'=>'Aṣayan yii le ran lọwọ lati ṣe atunṣe iyipada kaṣe fun diẹ ninu awọn alejo alagbeka tabi tabulẹti to ti ni ilọsiwaju.','Guest Mode testing result'=>'Abajade idanwo ipo alejo','Testing'=>'Àdánwò','Guest Mode IP/UA sync status'=>'Ipò ìmúṣọ̀pọ̀ IP/UA fún Ìpò Àlejò','Syncing'=>'Ìṣọ̀kan lọ́wọ́','Guest Mode passed testing.'=>'Ọna Òpòlọpọ ti kọja idanwo.','Guest Mode failed to test.'=>'Ìpò Àlejò kùnà láti dánwò.','Synced successfully.'=>'A ti mu ìgbékalẹ̀ rẹ̀ bá dọ́gba ní àṣeyọrí.','Sync failed.'=>'Ìmúdọ̀gbọ́ kùnà.','Image Optimization Summary'=>'Àkótán Ìmúgbòrò Àwòrán','Image Optimization Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìmúrasílẹ̀ Àwòrán','Zinn® Cache Engine Image Optimization'=>'Ìṣètò Ère Àwòrán Zinn® Cache Engine','Request WebP/AVIF versions of original images when doing optimization.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ń ṣe ìmúṣẹ́dára, bèèrè fún àwọn ẹ̀dà WebP/AVIF ti àwọn àwòrán àkọ́kọ́.','Significantly improve load time by replacing images with their optimized %s versions.'=>'Ẹ mú ìwọ̀n àkókò ìgbékalẹ̀ dára sí i gan-an nípa rirọ́pò àwọn àwòrán pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀yà %s wọn tí a ti mú dára sí i.','When switching formats, please %1$s or %2$s to apply this new choice to previously optimized images.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ń yí àwọn ọ̀nà ìṣètò padà, jọ̀wọ́ %1$s tàbí %2$s láti lò àṣàyàn tuntun yìí sórí àwọn àwòrán tí a ti mú dára tẹ́lẹ̀.','Destroy All Optimization Data'=>'Pa gbogbo Data Ìmúṣẹ́ rẹ́','Soft Reset Optimization Counter'=>'Atọka Ìmúgbòrò Àtúnṣe Ọ̀fẹ́','Automatically request optimization via cron job.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni kí o fi wọ́n sínú ìbéèrè iṣẹ́ cron fún ìmúgbòoro aládàáṣe.','Optimize images and save backups of the originals in the same folder.'=>'Ṣe àtúnṣe àwọn àwòrán kí o sì pa àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ àkọ́kọ́ mọ́ sínú fọ́lídà kan náà.','Automatically remove the original image backups after fetching optimized images.'=>'Yọ awọn afẹyinti aworan atilẹba kuro laifọwọyi lẹhin gbigba awọn aworan ti a ti mu dara si.','This is irreversible.'=>'Ko ṣe le tunṣe si ipo tẹlẹ.','You will be unable to Revert Optimization once the backups are deleted!'=>'O o ni le yipada Iṣapejuwe naa lẹhin ti a ba pa awọn àfidopo rẹẹ re!','Optimize images using lossless compression.'=>'Mu awọn aworan dara si nipa lilo fisile ti ko sọnu.','This can improve quality but may result in larger images than lossy compression will.'=>'Èyí lè mú kí dídára sunwọ̀n sí i sùgbọ́n ó lè jẹ́ kí àwọn àwòrán tóbi jù ti ìtẹ̀jáde tí kò lè pa ohun gbogbo mọ́ déédéé.','No sizes found.'=>'Ko si awọn iwọn ti a rii.','Choose which image sizes to optimize.'=>'Yan awọn iwọn aw画像 ti o fẹ lati mu dara si.','Preserve EXIF data (copyright, GPS, comments, keywords, etc) when optimizing.'=>'Tọ́jú dátà EXIF (ẹ̀tọ́ àwọn aṣẹ̀dá, GPS, àwọn àlàyé, àwọn kọ́kọ́rọ́ ọ̀rọ̀, àti bẹ́ẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ) nígbà tí o bá ń mú ohun gbogbo rọrùn láti lò.','This will increase the size of optimized files.'=>'Èyí yóò mú ìwọ̀n àwọn fáìlì tí a ti mú dára sí i pọ̀ sí i.','Specify which element attributes will be replaced with WebP/AVIF.'=>'Ṣọ tọ́ka àwọn ànímọ́ eroja wo ni a óò fi WebP/AVIF rọ́pọ̀.','Enable replacement of WebP/AVIF in %s elements that were generated outside of WordPress logic.'=>'Jẹ ki rirọpo WebP/AVIF ṣiṣẹ ninu awọn eroja %s ti a da jade ni ita ọgbọn-ori WordPress.','Current closest Cloud server is %s. Click to redetect.'=>'Olupin ti o sunmọ julọ lọwọlọwọ ni %s. Tẹ lati tun rii.','Are you sure you want to redetect the closest cloud server for this service?'=>'Ṣé o dá ọ lójú pé o fẹ́ tún wá ẹ̀rọ alámọ̀ ti àwṣánmà tí ó sún mọ́ ọn jù lọ fún iṣẹ́ yìí?','Redetect'=>'Tun se iwari re','Image optimisation'=>'Ìgbéga àwòrán','You can request a maximum of %s images at once.'=>'O le beere fun o pọju awọn aworan %s ni ẹẹkan.','To make sure our server can communicate with your server without any issues and everything works fine, for the few first requests the number of image groups allowed in a single request is limited.'=>'Lati ri daju pe sifa wa le ba sifa re soro laisi isoro kankan ati pe ohun gbogbo n sise daradara, fun awọn ibeere diẹ akọkọ, nọmba awọn ẹgbẹ aworan ti a gba laaye ninu ibeere kan ni opin.','Current limit is'=>'Èǹkà lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ jẹ́','Send Optimization Request'=>'Fi Ìbéèrè Ìṣelọ́pọ̀ Ranṣẹ','Available after %d second(s)'=>'O wa lẹhin iṣẹju-aya %d','Only press the button if the pull cron job is disabled.'=>'Tẹ bọtini náа nìkan tí iṣẹ cron ti pọọlu bá ti wa ni pipa.','Images will be pulled automatically if the cron job is running.'=>'A o fa awọn aworan wọle laifọwọyi ti iṣẹ cron ba nṣiṣẹ.','Pull Images'=>'Fa Awọn aworan wọle','Optimization Status'=>'Ipò Ìmúṣẹ Àgbàyọ','When the optimisation server finishes, it notifies your site to pull the optimised images.'=>'Nígbà tí sẹ̀ǹtàlù ìmúlò bá parí, ó sọ fún ojú òpó wẹ́bù rẹ láti fa àwọn àwòrán tí a mú dára wọ̀lé.','This process is automatic.'=>'Ìlànà yìí jẹ́ alápá-ìṣe-fúnra-rẹ̀.','Last pull initiated by cron at %s.'=>'Ikẹhin ti cron bẹrẹ ni %s.','Storage Optimization'=>'Ìṣètò Ìpamọ́','A backup of each image is saved before it is optimized.'=>'A fipamọ afẹyinti ti aworan kọọkan ṣaaju ki o to di mimu dara si.','Last calculated'=>'Ìṣirò tó kẹ́yìn','Files'=>'Àwọn fáìlì','Calculate Original Image Storage'=>'Ṣe ìṣirò ibi-ipamọ aworan atilẹba','Calculate Backups Disk Space'=>'Ṣe Iṣiro Ibi Ipamọ Àfikún fún Àwọn Àwòkọ Ipamọ','Image Thumbnail Group Sizes'=>'Àwọn Ìwọ̀n Ẹgbẹ́ Àwọn Àwòrán Kékeré','Delete all backups of the original images'=>'Pa gbogbo awọn àfikún (backup) ti awọn aworan atilẹba kuro','Last ran'=>'Ìgbà ìkẹyìn tí ó ṣiṣẹ́','Saved'=>'A ti fipamọ','Are you sure you want to remove all image backups?'=>'Ṣe o ni idaniloju pe o fẹ yọ gbogbo afẹyinti aworan kuro?','Remove Original Image Backups'=>'Yọ Àwọn Àwòrán Àkọ́kọ́ Tí Ó Ṣe Àtìlẹ́yìn Kúrò','Image Information'=>'Ìsọwọ́nsí Àwòrán','Image groups total'=>'Àwọn ẹgbẹ́ àwòrán lápapọ̀','Congratulations, all gathered!'=>'E ku oriire, gbogbo rẹ ti pejọ!','What is a group?'=>'Kini ẹgbẹ kan?','What is an image group?'=>'Kini ẹgbẹ aworan kan?','Current image post id position'=>'Ipo id fọto lọwọlọwọ','Maximum image post id'=>'ID ifi nla to pọ julọ','Scan for any new unoptimized image thumbnail sizes and resend necessary image optimization requests.'=>'Ṣayẹwo fún àwọn ìwọ̀n àwòrán kékeré tuntun tí kò tíì jẹ́ kí ó rọrùn láti lò, kí o sì tún fi àwọn ìbéèrè fún ìṣètò àwòrán tí ó yẹ ránṣẹ́.','Rescan New Thumbnails'=>'Tún ṣàyẹ̀wò àwọn àwòrán kékeré tuntun','Optimization Summary'=>'Àkópọ̀ Ìmúgbòrò','Total Reduction'=>'Ìdínkù lápapọ̀','Images Pulled'=>'Àwọn àwòrán tí a fà yọ','Last Request'=>'Ìbéèrè Tó Kẹ́yìn','Last Pulled'=>'Ti a fa jade kẹhin','Results can be checked in %sMedia Library%s.'=>'Àwọn àbájáde náà ni a lè ṣàyẹ̀wò nínú %sIlé Ìkópamọ́ Mídíà%s.','Optimization Tools'=>'Ohun Èlò Ìmúṣẹ Dáradára','You can quickly switch between using original (unoptimized versions) and optimized image files. It will affect all images on your website, both regular and webp versions if available.'=>'O le yipada ni kiakia laarin lilo awọn faili aworan atilẹba (awọn ẹya ti ko ni iṣapeye) ati awọn ti a ti ṣe iṣapeye. Yoo ni ipa lori gbogbo awọn aworan lori oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ, mejeeji deede ati awọn ẹya webp ti o ba wa.','Use original images (unoptimized) on your site'=>'Lo awọn àwòrán ìpilẹ̀ṣẹ̀ (ti ko tii dinku ni iwọn) sori aaye ayelujara rẹ','Use Original Files'=>'Lo Awọn Fáìlì Atilẹba','Switch back to using optimized images on your site'=>'Pad bẹ sí lilo awọn aworan ti a ti mu dara si lori aaye rẹ','Use Optimized Files'=>'Lo Awọn Fáìlì Tó Dára Jùlọ','This will reset the %1$s. If you changed WebP/AVIF settings and want to generate %2$s for the previously optimized images, use this action.'=>'Èyí yóò tún %1$s ṣe gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìbẹ̀rẹ̀. Tí o bá yí àwọn ètò WebP/AVIF padà tí o sì fẹ́ dá %2$s sílẹ̀ fún àwọn àwòrán tí a ti mú dára tẹ́lẹ̀ rí, lo ìgbésẹ̀ yìí.','Are you sure to destroy all optimized images?'=>'Njẹ o ni idaniloju lati pa gbogbo aworan ti a ti mu dara rẹ run bi?','Remove all previous image optimization requests/results, revert completed optimizations, and delete all optimization files.'=>'Yọ gbogbo ibeere/èṣì ìṣamulo àwòrán tó ti kọjá kúrò, da àwọn ìṣamulo tí a parí padà sí ipò wọn tẹ́lẹ̀, kí o sì pa gbogbo fáìlì ìṣamulo rẹ́.','Read the upstream Zinn® Cache Engine documentation'=>'Ka iwe afọwọkọ Zinn® Cache Engine ti o wa ni isalẹ','Zinn Digital® support'=>'Atileyin Zinn Digital®','Zinn® Cache Engine user guide'=>'Itẹsẹ olumulo Zinn® Cache Engine','To use the caching functions you must have a LiteSpeed or OpenLiteSpeed web server with the LSCache module.'=>'Lati lo awọn iṣẹ caching, o gbọdọ ni wẹbu sẹẹfa ti LiteSpeed tabi OpenLiteSpeed pẹlu module LSCache.','Please enable the LSCache Module at the server level, or ask your hosting provider.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ mú LSCache Module ṣiṣẹ́ ní ipele sẹ̀fà (server), tàbí kí o béèrè lọ́wọ́ olùpèsè ìgbékalẹ̀ wẹ́bù rẹ.','Please enable Zinn® Cache Engine in the plugin settings.'=>'Jọwọ jẹ ki Zinn® Cache Engine ṣiṣẹ ninu awọn eto afikun (plugin settings).','LSCache caching functions on this page are currently unavailable!'=>'Awọn iṣẹ ifipamọ LSCache lori oju-iwe yii ko si ni bayi!','The network admin selected use primary site configs for all subsites.'=>'Alákóso nétwìkì náà yan lílo àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹ́sẹ́ ojú òpó wẹ́bù àkọ́kọ́ fún gbogbo àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù kékeré náà.','The following options are selected, but are not editable in this settings page.'=>'Awon aṣayan wọnyi ti yan, ṣugbodun wọn ko le ṣe atunṣe ni oju-iwe eto yii.','LiteSpeed cache plugin upgraded. Please refresh the page to complete the configuration data upgrade.'=>'Wọọṣi LiteSpeed cache plugin ti ni imudojuiwọn. Jọwọ sọ oju-iwe naa di tuntun lati pari imudojuiwọn data iṣeto ni.','Deactivate Zinn® Cache Engine'=>'Ṣe àìníṣẹ́ rẹ̀ mọ́ Ẹrọ Ìpamọ́ Zinn® Cache Engine','The deactivation is temporary'=>'Ìmúkúrò náà jẹ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀','Site performance is worse'=>'Iṣẹ́ ojula buru si','Plugin is too complicated'=>'Gidigidi ni Pilogin náà','Other'=>'Elomiran','Why are you deactivating the plugin?'=>'Kilode ti o fi n pa plọọgi náà rẹ?','On uninstall, all plugin settings will be deleted.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá yọ ọ́ kúrò, gbogbo àwọn ètò plugin náà ni a óò pa rẹ́.','If you have used Image Optimization, please %sDestroy All Optimization Data%s first. NOTE: this does not remove your optimized images.'=>'Bi o ba ti lo Iṣapejuwe Aworan, jọwọ %sPa Gbogbo Awọn Data Iṣapejuwe run%s kọkọ. AKIYESI: eyi ko yọ awọn aworan rẹ ti a ṣe iṣapejuwe kuro.','Deactivate'=>'Pa aṣẹ rẹ tì','Deactivate plugin'=>'Ṣe àìníṣẹ́ lórí bọ́tìnnì rẹ̀','Close popup'=>'Pa agbejade pada','Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is installed!'=>'A ti fi ìtòjú àfikún Zinn® Cache Engine sori rẹ!','This message indicates that the plugin was installed by the server admin.'=>'Ifiranṣẹ yii fihan pe olùṣàkóso sẹ́bàà ni ó fi plọ́ọ̀gìnnì náà sílẹ̀.','The Zinn® Cache Engine plugin is used to cache pages - a simple way to improve the performance of the site.'=>'Aọn plugin Zinn® Cache Engine ni a nlo latifi fipamọ awọn oju-iwe sinu akọpamọ (cache) - ọna ti o rọrun lati mu iṣẹ ṣiṣe aaye naa dara si.','However, there is no way of knowing all the possible customizations that were implemented.'=>'Síbẹ̀síbẹ̀, kò sí ọ̀nà láti mọ gbogbo àwọn àṣàyàn ìtòsí tí ó ṣeéṣe tí a ti fi sílò.','For that reason, please test the site to make sure everything still functions properly.'=>'Nitori náà, jọ̀wọ́ dánwò ojú-wẹ̀bù náà láti rí i dájú pé ohun gbogbo ṣì ń ṣiṣẹ́ daradara.','Examples of test cases include:'=>'Àwọn àpẹẹrẹ àwọn ìdánwò náà ní nínú:','Visit the site while logged out.'=>'Ṣẹ́ àbẹ̀wò sí ojú-òpó wẹ́bù náà nígbà tí o kò wọlé.','Create a post, make sure the front page is accurate.'=>'Ṣẹda àpilẹ̀kọ kan, ri sí pe ojú ewé iwájú péye.','If there are any questions, the team is always happy to answer any questions on the %ssupport forum%s.'=>'Bi àwọn ìbéèrè bá wà, ẹ̀gbẹ́ náà máa ń dùn ún láti dáhùn èyíkéyìí ìbéèrè lórí %ssupport forum%s.','If you would rather not move at litespeed, you can deactivate this plugin.'=>'Tí o bá fẹ́ láti má ṣe lọ sí litespeed, o lè pa aṣàfikún yìí rẹ́.','NOTICE: Database login cookie did not match your login cookie.'=>'AKIYESI: Kuki ìwọ̀lé ibi ipamọ́ data kò bá kuki ìwọ̀lé rẹ mu.','If the login cookie was recently changed in the settings, please log out and back in.'=>'Bí ó bá jẹ́ pé wọ́n ti yí kuki ìwọlé padà láìpẹ́ yìí nínú àwọn ètò, jọ̀wọ́ jáde kí o sì tún wọlé.','If not, please verify the setting in the %sAdvanced tab%s.'=>'Tí kò bá rẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀, jọ̀wọ́ ṣàyẹ̀wò ètò náà nínú taabu %sAdvanced%s.','If using OpenLiteSpeed, the server must be restarted once for the changes to take effect.'=>'Tí o bá nlo OpenLiteSpeed, a gbọdọ tun server naa bẹrẹ lẹẹkan ṣoṣo ki awọn ayipada le ni ipa.','Unexpected cache rule %2$s found in %1$s file. This rule may cause visitors to see old versions of pages due to the browser caching HTML pages. If you are sure that HTML pages are not being browser cached, this message can be dismissed. (%3$sLearn More%4$s)'=>'A ko nifẹ si ofin cache %2$s ti a ri ninu faili %1$s. Ofin yii le fa ki awọn alejo ri awọn ẹya atijọ ti awọn oju-iwe nitori cache ẹrọ aṣawakiri ti n ṣe cache awọn oju-iwe HTML. Ti o ba ni idaniloju pe awọn oju-iwe HTML ko ni a to si cache ẹrọ aṣawakiri, o le pa ifiranṣẹ yii tì. (%3$sKọ ẹkọ diẹ sii%4$s)','OptimaX Summary'=>'Akopọ OptimaX','OptimaX Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ OptimaX','Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine OptimaX','Turn on OptimaX. This will automatically request your pages OptimaX result via cron job.'=>'Tan OptimaX si. Eyi yoo ni talọ̀tọ̀ tọrọ abajade OptimaX ti awọn oju-iwe rẹ nipasẹ cron job.','CSS Settings'=>'Awọn Eto CSS','JS Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìètò JS','HTML Settings'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ HTML','Media Settings'=>'Ètò Ilé-iṣẹ́ Aṣàgbéjade','VPI'=>'VPI','Media Excludes'=>'Àwọn ohun tí a yọ kúrò nínú media','Localization'=>'Ìṣàgbékalẹ̀ sí èdè agbègbè','Tuning'=>'Àtúnṣe','Zinn® Cache Engine Page Optimization'=>'Ètò Ìmúrasílẹ̀ Ojúewé Zinn® Cache Engine','Please test thoroughly when enabling any option in this list. After changing Minify/Combine settings, please do a Purge All action.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ dánwò dáadáa nígbà tí o bá mú ẹ̀yọ̀ kankan ṣiṣẹ́ nínú àkójọ yìí. Lẹ́yìn ti o bá ti yí àwọn ètò Minify/Combine padà, jọ̀wọ́ ṣe ìgbésẹ̀ Purge All kan.','Minify CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Fi awọn faili CSS kékeré si àti fi koodu CSS sínú rẹ̀.','Combine CSS files and inline CSS code.'=>'Darapọ awọn faksi CSS ati koodu CSS ti o wa ninu rẹ.','How to Fix Problems Caused by CSS/JS Optimization.'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a ṣe lè tún àwọn ìṣòro tí ìmúṣẹ CSS/JS fa ṣe.','Generate unique CSS through an online generation service.'=>'Se àṣẹ́ pẹ̀lú fọ́ọ̀mù CSS alátọ́ka alátẹ́gùn kan nípasẹ̀ iṣẹ́ ẹ̀dá lórí ẹ̀rọ ayélujára.','This will drop the unused CSS on each page from the combined file.'=>'Èyí yóò mú CSS tí kò nílò kúrò lórí ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan láti inú fáìlì tí a pọ̀ pọ̀.','Automatic generation of unique CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ṣẹ̀ àǹfààní àrà ọ̀tọ̀ ti CSS wà ní ẹ̀yìn nípasẹ̀ ìlànà cron-based queue.','Filter %s available for UCSS per page type generation.'=>'Àlẹmọ %s wà fún ìṣẹ̀dá UCSS fún irú ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan.','This option is bypassed because %1$s option is %2$s.'=>'A yí ipò yìí ka padà nítorí pé aṣayan %1$s jẹ́ %2$s.','Last generated'=>'Àìpẹ́ yìí ni a dáa sílẹ̀','Last requested cost'=>'Iye idi ti abeere kẹhin','URL list in %s queue waiting for cron'=>'Àtòjọ URL tó wà nínú ìlà %s tó ń dúró de cron','Clear'=>'Pa kuro','Run %s Queue Manually'=>'Lo %s Queue Fún Ara Rẹ̀','Inline UCSS to reduce the extra CSS file loading. This option will not be automatically turned on for %1$s pages. To use it on %1$s pages, please set it to ON.'=>'UCSS Inlaid lati dinku ikojọpọ faili CSS afikun. A kii yoo tan aṣayan yii laifọwọyi fun awọn oju-iwe %1$s. Lati lo lori awọn oju-iwe %1$s, jọwọ ṣeto rẹ si ON.','This option will automatically bypass %s option.'=>'Aṣayan yii yoo foju fo aṣayan %s laifọwọyi.','Include external CSS and inline CSS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of CSS, which should minimize potential errors caused by CSS Combine.'=>'Fi CSS ita gbangba ati CSS ti a fi sinu rẹ kun si faili ti a dapọ nigbati a ba tun mu %1$s ṣiṣẹ. Aṣayan yii n ran lọwọ lati ṣetọju awọn pataki ti CSS, eyiti o yẹ ki o dinku awọn aṣiṣe ti o pọju ti CSS Combine fa.','Optimize CSS delivery.'=>'Mú kíni fífi CSS ránṣẹ́ sunwọ̀n si.','This can improve your speed score in services like Pingdom, GTmetrix and PageSpeed.'=>'Èyí lè mú kí àmì ìyára rẹ sunwọ̀n sí i nínú àwọn iṣẹ́ bíi Pingdom, GTmetrix àti PageSpeed.','Generate critical CSS through an online generation service and load the remaining CSS asynchronously.'=>'Se awon CSS pataki lilo ise iranwo lori ayelujara ki o si se agbele si awon CSS ti o ku ni ona aisi akoko kan pataki.','Automatic generation of critical CSS is in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀sẹ̀ aifọwọyi ti CSS to ṣe pataki wa ní ìpìlẹ̀ nípasẹ̀ ìlà-iṣẹ́ cron.','When this option is turned %s, it will also load Google Fonts asynchronously.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá tan aṣàyàn yìí mọ́ %s, yóò tún kó Google Fonts nípasẹ̀ àìnífẹ̀ẹ́-ìṣẹ́jọ.','Elements with attribute %s in HTML code will be excluded.'=>'Awon apakan ti o ni abuda %s ninu kodu HTML ni a o yọ kuro.','This option is bypassed due to %s option.'=>'Aṣayan yii kọja nitori aṣayan %s.','Disable this option to generate CCSS per Post Type instead of per page. This can save significant CCSS quota, however it may result in incorrect CSS styling if your site uses a page builder.'=>'Mu aṣayan yii kuro lati ṣe ina CCSS fun Iru Ifiṣura kọọkan dipo fun oju-iwe kọọkan. Eyi le fi kuota CCSS pamọ pupọ, ṣugbọn o le ja si ara CSS ti ko tọ ti oju opo wẹẹbu rẹ ba nlo oluṣe oju-iwe kan.','This will inline the asynchronous CSS library to avoid render blocking.'=>'Èyí yóò gbé ilé-kíkọ́ CSS aláìnífẹ̀ẹ́-kankan sínú rẹ̀ tààrà láti yẹra fún ìdènà ìfihàn.','Default'=>'Àiyipada','Set this to append %1$s to all %2$s rules before caching CSS to specify how fonts should be displayed while being downloaded.'=>'Ṣe èyí láti fi %1$s kún gbogbo àwọn òfin %2$s ṣáájú kí o tó fi CSS pamọ́ láti sọ bí ó ṣe yẹ kí àwọn fọ́ǹtì hàn nígbà tí wọ́n ń ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀.','%s is recommended.'=>'A gba ọ niyanju lati lo %s.','Swap'=>'Paṣiparọ','Minify HTML content.'=>'Kọ àwọn àkóónú HTML kúrò láti fi ṣe wíwúrà rẹ̀ púpọ̀.','Prefetching DNS can reduce latency for visitors.'=>'Ikojọpọ DNS tẹlẹ le dinku idaduro fun awọn alejo.','For example'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ','Automatically enable DNS prefetching for all URLs in the document, including images, CSS, JavaScript, and so forth.'=>'Fi agbara ṣiṣẹ DNS prefetching laifọwọyi fun gbogbo awọn URL ninu iwe aṣẹ naa, pẹlu awọn aworan, CSS, JavaScript, ati bẹẹ lọ.','This can improve the page loading speed.'=>'Èyí lè mú kí ìyára ìkójọpọ̀ ojú-ewé náà sunwọ̀n síi.','Preconnecting speeds up future loads from a given origin.'=>'Ìsopọ̀ tẹlẹ rọ̀ oju opo wẹẹbu iyara fún àwọn ìgbà wọ̀ wá láti orísun kan.','Delay rendering off-screen HTML elements by its selector.'=>'Pa idad agbewọle awọn ohun elo HTML ti o wa ni ita iboju nipasẹ oluyan rẹ.','When minifying HTML do not discard comments that match a specified pattern.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ń dín iwọ̀n HTML kù, má sọ àwọn àlàyé tí ó bá àpẹẹrẹ kan mu nù.','If comment to be kept is like: %1$s write: %2$s'=>'Tí àpèjúwe tí a fẹ́ pa mọ́ bá rí báyìí: %1$s kọ: %2$s','Remove query strings from internal static resources.'=>'Yọ àwọn okùn ìbéèrè kúrò nínú àwọn ohun èlò abẹ́nú tí kì í yí padà.','Google reCAPTCHA will be bypassed automatically.'=>'A o fo Google reCAPTCHA yẹn laisi afikun igbese kan.','Append query string %s to the resources to bypass this action.'=>'Fi okun ibeere %s kun awọn ohun elo naa lati kọja iṣe yii silẹ.','Use Web Font Loader library to load Google Fonts asynchronously while leaving other CSS intact.'=>'Lo ikarahun ile-iṣẹ Web Font Loader lati gbe Google Fonts soke ni ọna aiṣe-taara lakoko ti o nfi CSS miiran silẹ bẹẹni.','This will also add a preconnect to Google Fonts to establish a connection earlier.'=>'Èyí yóò tún fi àfikún ìsopọ̀ tẹ́lẹ̀ sí Google Fonts láti fìdí ìsopọ̀ múlẹ̀ ní kíákíá.','Prevent Google Fonts from loading on all pages.'=>'Dena ki Google Fonts máṣe kó lórí gbogbo ojú ewé.','Stop loading WordPress.org emoji. Browser default emoji will be displayed instead.'=>'Dá kikun WordPress.org emoji duro. Awọn emoji aiyipada aṣàwákiri ni a o han dipo rẹ.','This option will remove all %s tags from HTML.'=>'Aṣayan yii yoo yọ gbogbo awọn afi %s kuro ninu HTML.','Minify JS files and inline JS codes.'=>'Kúrú àwọn fáìlì JS kí o sì gbin àwọn kóòdù JS sínú rẹ̀.','Combine all local JS files into a single file.'=>'Darapọ gbogbo awọn faili JS agbegbe sinu faili kan soso.','This option may result in a JS error or layout issue on frontend pages with certain themes/plugins.'=>'Aṣayan yii le fa aṣiṣe JS kan tabi iṣoro ifilelẹ lori awọn oju-iwe iwaju pẹlu awọn akọle/awọn afikun kan.','JS error can be found from the developer console of browser by right clicking and choosing Inspect.'=>'A le ri aṣiṣe JS lati inu console olùgbélèrorò ti aṣàwákiri nipa tite ọtun ti o si yan Inspect.','Include external JS and inline JS in combined file when %1$s is also enabled. This option helps maintain the priorities of JS execution, which should minimize potential errors caused by JS Combine.'=>'Fi JS ita ati JS abẹnu sinu faili ti a dapọ nigbati %1$s ba tun ṣiṣẹ. Aṣayan yii n ṣe iranlọwọ lati ṣetọju awọn pataki ti ipaniyan JS, eyiti o yẹ ki o dinku awọn aṣiṣe ti o pọju ti o fa nipasẹ JS Combine.','Deferred'=>'Ti sun siwaju','Delayed'=>'Ti a sun siwaju','Deferring until page is parsed or delaying till interaction can help reduce resource contention and improve performance causing a lower FID (Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Wiwà di àkókò tí a ti ṣe àtúnyẹwò ojú-ewé tabi fifun ni àkókò diẹ siwaju titi di ibaraẹnisọrọ le ranlowo lati dinku idije awọn ohun elo ati ilọsiwaju iṣẹ ṣiṣe ti nfa FID kekere kan (Core Web Vitals metric).','Failed to create Avatar table. Please follow <a %s>Table Creation guidance from LiteSpeed Wiki</a> to finish setup.'=>'O kùn láti dá tábìlì Avatar kalẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ tẹ̀ lé <a %s>Ìtọ́sọ́nà Ẹ̀dá Tábìlì láti orí LiteSpeed Wiki</a> láti parí iṣẹ́ ìṣètò náà.','Localization Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Agbegbe','Store Gravatar locally.'=>'Tọju Gravatar sí agbegbe.','Accelerates the speed by caching Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars).'=>'Ó máa ń mú kí iyára pọ síi nípa títọ́jú Gravatar (Globally Recognized Avatars) sí ibi ìpamọ́fẹ́lẹ́fẹ́.','Refresh Gravatar cache by cron.'=>'Sọ ìpamọ́ Gravatar di tuntun nípa lílo cron.','Avatar list in queue waiting for update'=>'Àtòjọ àwọn àfòúsùn tó wà ní ìlà dè láti ṣe ìgbékalẹ̀ wọn','Run Queue Manually'=>'Ṣiṣẹ́ Ìlà Sùwù Máǹjúàlì','Specify how long, in seconds, Gravatar files are cached.'=>'Ṣe àlàyé bí ó ṣe pẹ́ tó, ní àwọn ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá, tí a fi ń pa àwọn fáìlì Gravatar mọ́ sí ibi ìpamọ́ ìgbà díẹ̀.','Localize external resources.'=>'Ṣe agbegbe si awọn ohun elo ita.','Please thoroughly test all items in %s to ensure they function as expected.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́ dánwò dáadáa gbogbo àwọn ohun tó wà nínú %s láti rí i pé wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ti retí.','Resources listed here will be copied and replaced with local URLs.'=>'Awọn ohun elo ti a ṣe akojọ rẹ nibi ni a o daako ati pe a o rọpo pẹlu awọn URL agbegbe.','HTTPS sources only.'=>'Awọn orisun HTTPS nikan.','Comments are supported. Start a line with a %s to turn it into a comment line.'=>'A n ṣe àtìlẹyìn fún àwọn asọye. Bẹrẹ ìlà kan pẹlu %s lati sọ di ìlà asọye.','Example'=>'Apẹẹrẹ','Please thoroughly test each JS file you add to ensure it functions as expected.'=>'Jọ̀wọ́, ṣe àwọn àyẹ̀wò kíkún fún fáìlì JS kọ̀ọ̀kan tí o fi kún un láti rí i daju pé ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí a ti retí.','Load images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Ṣe igbasilẹ awọn aworan nikan nigbati wọn ba wọ inu agbegbe wiwo (viewport).','This can improve page loading time by reducing initial HTTP requests.'=>'Èyí lè mú kí àkókò ìgbéṣe ojúewé sunwọ̀n sí i nípa dídinku àwọn ìbéèrè HTTP àkọ́kọ́.','Adding Style to Your Lazy-Loaded Images'=>'Fífikún Àṣà sí àwọn àwòrán Rẹ Tí A Ṣe Àgbékalẹ̀ Rẹ̀ Ní Ọ̀lẹ','Specify a base64 image to be used as a simple placeholder while images finish loading.'=>'Tọ́ka àwòrán base64 kan tí a ó lò gẹ́gẹ́ bí ààyè ìdúró tí ó rọrù parí nígbà tí àwòrán bá ń gbé wọlé.','This can be predefined in %2$s as well using constant %1$s, with this setting taking priority.'=>'Èyí tún lè jẹ́ ṣíṣáájú tẹ́lẹ̀ nínú %2$s pẹ̀lú lílo kọnsítàǹtì %1$s, pẹ̀lú ètò yìí tí ó ní àǹfààní àkọ́kọ́.','By default a gray image placeholder %s will be used.'=>'Nípa àìnísọ́tọ̀, àwòrán ààyè tí ó jẹ́ eérú %s ni a óò lò.','For example, %s can be used for a transparent placeholder.'=>'Fún àpẹẹrẹ, a lè lo %s fún ààyè aláìfarahan.','Responsive image placeholders can help to reduce layout reshuffle when images are loaded.'=>'Àwọn ààyè àwòrán tó lè múra sípò lè mú kí ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ ojú ìwé má bàa yí padà nígbà tí àwòrán bá ń wọlé.','This will generate the placeholder with same dimensions as the image if it has the width and height attributes.'=>'Èyí yóò dá ààyè tí ó ní ìwọ̀n kan náà mọ́ àwùjọ bíi ti àwòrán náà tí ó bá ní àwọn ànímọ́ ìbú (width) àti gíga (height).','Specify an SVG to be used as a placeholder when generating locally.'=>'Sọ SVG kan ti a yoo lo gẹgẹ bi ibi-ipamọ nigbati o ba n ṣe agbekalẹ ni agbegbe.','It will be converted to a base64 SVG placeholder on-the-fly.'=>'A o yipada si apẹẹrẹ base64 SVG lẹsẹkẹsẹ.','Variables %s will be replaced with the corresponding image properties.'=>'Awọn iyipada %s yoo jẹ rirọpo pẹlu awọn ohun-ini aworan ti o baamu.','Variables %s will be replaced with the configured background color.'=>'Awon iyipada %s ni a o ropo pelu awon awọ abẹlẹ ti a tun to.','Specify the responsive placeholder SVG color.'=>'Ṣọ̀tàn àwọ̀ SVG tó máa ń yípadà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìwọ̀n ojú ìwé.','Generate Low Quality Image Placeholders through an online generation service, for responsive image previews while loading.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá àwọn ibi ìpamọ́ àwòrán dídára kékèké nípasẹ̀ iṣẹ́ ìṣẹ̀dá lórí ayélujára, fún àwọn àwòrán àkọ́kọ́ tí ó dáhùn nígbà tí wọ́n ń kó.','Keep this off to use plain color placeholders.'=>'Jẹ ki eyi wa ni pipa lati lo awọn aaye afihan awọ pẹlẹbẹ.','Specify the quality when generating LQIP.'=>'Ṣọ agbara didara náà nígbà tí o bá ń dá LQIP.','Larger number will generate higher resolution quality placeholder, but will result in larger files which will increase page size and consume more points.'=>'Nọ́mbà tó tóbi jù yoo pèsè àwọn àwòrán ààyè tí ó ní ìmọ́lẹ̀ gíga jù, ṣugbọn yoo yọrisi àwọn fáìlì tí ó tóbi jù èyí tí yoo mú ìwọn ojú-ewé pọ̀ si yoo sì jẹ àwọn àmì pọ̀ si.','Changes to this setting do not apply to already-generated LQIPs. To regenerate existing LQIPs, please %s first from the admin bar menu.'=>'Awọn ayipada si eto yii ko kan awọn LQIP ti a ti ṣe tẹlẹ. Lati tun ṣe awọn LQIP ti o wa tẹlẹ, jọwọ %s ni akọkọ lati inu akoṣo aṣoju aaye.','pixels'=>'àwọn píksẹìlì','LQIP requests will not be sent for images where both width and height are smaller than these dimensions.'=>'A kò ní fi àwọn ìbéèrè LQIP ránṣẹ́ fún àwọn àwòrán tí ìbú àti giga wọnkéré ju àwọn ìwọ̀n wọ̀nyí lọ.','Automatically generate LQIP in the background via a cron-based queue.'=>'Ṣẹ̀dá LQIP fúnra rẹ̀ ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú ìlànà cron-based queue.','If set to %1$s, before the placeholder is localized, the %2$s configuration will be used.'=>'Tí a bá ṣètò sí %1$s, kí a tó ṣe àgbègbè fún ààyè tí a pèsè, a óò lo àwọn ìètò %2$s.','If set to %s this is done in the foreground, which may slow down page load.'=>'Bi a ba fi si %s eyi yoo ṣẹlẹ ni iwaju, eyi ti o le fa fifalẹ kika oju-iwe naa.','Size list in queue waiting for cron'=>'Iwọn atokọ ninu ilana ti n duro de cron','Load iframes only when they enter the viewport.'=>'Ṣe àlejò awọn iframes nikan nígbà tí wọ́n bá wọ inú ojú-àyè náà.','Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Ṣe agbekalẹ iwọn ibú àti giga ti ó hàn gbangba sori awọn eroja aworan lati dinku awọn iyipada ipilẹ ati ilọsiwaju CLS (iwọn Core Web Vitals kan).','Use %1$s to bypass remote image dimension check when %2$s is ON.'=>'Lo %1$s lati kọja ayẹwo iwọn awgetImage jina nigbati %2$s ba WA LORI.','The image compression quality setting of WordPress out of 100.'=>'Ètò ìwọ̀n ìṣẹ̀gbẹ́ àwòrán ti WordPress láti inú ọgọ́rùn-ún (100).','Automatically replace large images with scaled versions.'=>'Fi àwọn àwòrán ńlá rọ́pọ̀ láìṣe é fúnra rẹ pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹ̀yà tí a sọ diwọ̀n.','Scaled size threshold'=>'Ojú-wùn ìwọ̀n tí a ṣe àfikún sí','Filter %s available to change threshold.'=>'Ààyè fún àlẹ̀mọ́ %s wà láti yí ìwọ̀n padà.','Listed images will not be lazy loaded.'=>'A kò ní kó àwọn àwòrán tí a tò sínú rẹ̀ ní ọ̀nà ọ̀lẹ.','Useful for above-the-fold images causing CLS (a Core Web Vitals metric).'=>'Wulo fun awọn aworan ti o wa ni oke ti o fa CLS (iwọn Core Web Vitals kan).','Elements with attribute %s in html code will be excluded.'=>'Àwọn ohunèlò tó ní àmì-ìdánimọ̀ %s nínú kódù html ni a ó yọ kúrò.','Images containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Awọn aworan ti o ni awọn orukọ kilasi wọnyi kii yoo ni ẹru ọlẹ (lazy load).','Images having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Awọn aworan ti o ni awọn orukọkilasi obi wọnyi kii yoo jẹ ikojọpọ ọlẹ.','Iframes containing these class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Awon iframes ti o ni awon oruko kilasi wonyi ko ni gba fifojusi lori aago (lazy load).','Iframes having these parent class names will not be lazy loaded.'=>'Awon iframes ti o ni awon oruko kilasi obi wọnyi kii yoo ṣe igbasilẹ ọlẹ.','Prevent any lazy load of listed pages.'=>'Dèn gbogbo ìrù fúnra fún àwọn ojúewé tí a tò sílẹ̀.','These images will not generate LQIP.'=>'Awọn aworan wọnyi kii yoo ṣe ina LQIP.','Tuning Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìṣàkóso','Listed JS files or inline JS code will be delayed.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì JS tí a tò sílẹ̀ tàbí kóòdù JS inú ọ̀rọ̀ yóò pẹ́.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì JS tí a tò sílẹ̀ tàbí kóòdù JS inú ìwé kò ní jẹ́ kí wọ́n ké kéré tàbí kí a da pọ̀ mọ́ra wọn.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings.'=>'Akojọ ti a ti ṣètẹ silẹ ni yoo tun dapọ pẹlu awọn eto ti o wa loke.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be deferred or delayed.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì JS tí a tò sórí àtòjọ tàbí kóòdù JS inú ìwé kò ní jẹ́ kí a sún síwájú tàbí pẹ̀tẹ́lẹ̀.','Listed JS files or inline JS code will not be optimized by %s.'=>'Awọn 📁 JS ti a ṣe atunyẹwo tabi koodu JS ti a fi sii kii yoo ni ilọsiwaju nipasẹ %s.','Prevent any optimization of listed pages.'=>'Dènà ìṣèsí èyíkéyìí fún àwọn ojú ewé tí a tò sórí àkọsílẹ̀.','Only optimize pages for guest (not logged in) visitors. If turned this OFF, CSS/JS/CCSS files will be doubled by each user group.'=>'Ṣe iṣapeye awọn oju-iwe nikan fun awọn alejo (ti ko wọle). Ti o ba pa eyi rẹ, awọn faili CSS/JS/CCSS yoo pọ si ilopo meji nipasẹ ẹgbẹ olumulo kọọkan.','Selected roles will be excluded from all optimizations.'=>'A o yọ awọn ipa ti a yan kuro ninu gbogbo iṣapejuwe.','Tuning CSS Settings'=>'Ìtò Ẹ̀ka CSS','Listed CSS files or inline CSS code will not be minified or combined.'=>'Awọn faili CSS ti a ṣe akojọ tabi koodu CSS inline kii yoo jẹ mimọ tabi ni idapo.','Predefined list will also be combined with the above settings'=>'Akojọ ti a ti ṣètẹ silẹ ni yoo tun dapọ pẹlu awọn eto ti o wa loke','Listed CSS files will be excluded from UCSS and saved to inline.'=>'Awọn ₦kankan CSS ti a ṣe akoṣọ yoo jẹ iyasọtọ lati UCSS ati pe yoo fipamọ sinu inline.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in UCSS.'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ àwọn olùṣàyẹ̀wò CSS tí ó yẹ kí àwọn ìfarahàn wọn wà nínú UCSS nígbà gbogbo.','Learn more'=>'Kọ́ síwájú sí i','Wildcard %s supported.'=>'A ṣe atilẹyin wildcard %s.','The selector must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Olùṣàyàn náà gbọdọ̀ wà nínú CSS náà. Àwọn kílàsì òbí (parent classes) tó wà nínú HTML kì yóò ṣiṣẹ́.','Listed URI will not generate UCSS.'=>'Akojọ URI ti a fun kii yoo ṣe ina UCSS.','Use %1$s to generate one single UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s while other page types still per URL.'=>'Lo %1$s lati da UCSS kan soso jade fun awọn oju-iwe ti iru oju-iwe wọn jẹ %2$s lakoko ti awọn iru oju-iwe miiran n tẹsiwaju fun URL kọọkan.','Use %1$s to bypass UCSS for the pages which page type is %2$s.'=>'Lo %1$s lati fọ UCSS kọja fun awọn oju-iwe ti iru oju-iwe jẹ %2$s.','List post types where each item of that type should have its own CCSS generated.'=>'Ṣe àkọsọ irú àwọn ìfiránṣẹ́ níbi tí ohun kọ̀ọ̀kan lára irú yẹn ti yẹ kó ní CCSS tirẹ̀ tí a ṣe.','For example, if every Page on the site has different formatting, enter %s in the box. Separate critical CSS files will be stored for every Page on the site.'=>'Fún àpẹrẹ, tí ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sì náà bá ní ìṣètò tí ó yàtọ̀, tẹ %s sí inú àpótí náà. A óò tọjú àwọn fáìlì CSS pàtàkì tí ó yàtọ̀ fún ojú-ewé kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí ojú-wọ̀ọ̀sì náà.','Separate critical CSS files will be generated for paths containing these strings.'=>'A o da awon faili CSS pataki lọtọ fun awọn ọna ti o ni awọn okun wọnyi ndani.','List the CSS selectors whose styles should always be included in CCSS.'=>'Tẹ àwọn olùṣàyẹ̀wò CSS sílẹ̀ èyí tí ó yẹ kí àwọn àṣà wọn wà nínú CCSS nígbà gbogbo.','Selectors must exist in the CSS. Parent classes in the HTML will not work.'=>'Àwọn olùṣàyẹ̀wò gbọ́dọ̀ wà nínú CSS náà. Àwọn kíìsì òbí nínú HTML kì yóò ṣiṣẹ́.','Specify critical CSS rules for above-the-fold content when enabling %s.'=>'Sọ àwọn ìlànà CSS pàtàkì kalẹ̀ fún àwọn ohun tó wà lókè lẹ́ẹ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan nígbà tó o bá mú %s ṣiṣẹ́.','When you use Lazy Load, it will delay the loading of all images on a page.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá lo Lazy Load, yóò mú kí ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ ìkojọba gbogbo àwọn àwòrán tó wà lórí ojú-ewé kan fa sẹ́yìn.','The Viewport Images service detects which images appear above the fold, and excludes them from lazy load.'=>'Iṣẹ́ Viewport Images máa ń wá àwọn àwòrán tó wà lókè tí a kò tíì fojú rí lábéé nígbà tí ojú-ewé bá ṣí, ó sì ń yọ wọ́n kúrò nínú ìgbékalẹ̀ ọ̀lẹ (lazy load).','This enables the page\'s initial screenful of imagery to be fully displayed without delay.'=>'Èyí jẹ́ kí àwọn àwòrán tó wà lórí ojú-ewé ní ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ lè hàn kedere láìsí ìdúróṣe.','Enable Viewport Images auto generation cron.'=>'Jẹ ki iṣẹ́ agbọ̀sọ̀sílẹ̀ cron àwọn àwòrán fífihàn ojú-iṣẹ́ laifọwọsi ṣiṣẹ́.','Standard Presets'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ Alákọ̀ọ́ṣe','Import / Export'=>'Wọlé / Jade wọlé','Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets'=>'Àwọn Ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ Ìtòjọ Zinn® Cache Engine Configuration Presets','Essentials'=>'Àwọn Ohun Pàtàkì','Default Cache'=>'Aṣọ Ìpamọ́ Àìyípadà','Higher TTL'=>'TTL ti o ga julọ','This no-risk preset is appropriate for all websites. Good for new users, simple websites, or cache-oriented development.'=>'Ètò tí kò ní ewu yìí bá gbogbo ojú opó wẹ́bù mu. Ó dára fún àwọn olùlò tuntun, àwọn ojú opó wẹ́bù tí kò díjú, tàbí ìdàgbàsókè tí ó jẹ mọ́ ìpamọ́ (cache).','Only basic caching features are enabled. Every option in this preset works without any online service.'=>'Awọn aṣayan iṣura kekere nikan ni o ṣiṣẹ. Gbogbo aṣayan ninu eto yii n ṣiṣẹ laisi eyikeyi iṣẹ ori ayelujara.','Basic'=>'Nọ́malù','Everything in Essentials, Plus'=>'Gbogbo ohun ti o wa ninu Essentials, Pelu','Mobile Cache'=>'Kesh Ẹrọ Alagbeka','This low-risk preset introduces basic optimizations for speed and user experience. Appropriate for enthusiastic beginners.'=>'Ètò ìpìlẹ̀ tó ní ewu kékeré yìí ṣàfihàn àwọn ìṣètò ìṣiṣẹ́ tó rọrùn fún ìyára àti ìírí olùlò. Ó yẹ fún àwọn olùbẹ̀rẹ̀ tó ní ìtara.','Includes optimizations known to improve site score in page speed measurement tools. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Ó ní àwọn ìṣètò ìṣàfikún tí a mọ̀ pé ó ń mú àmì ojú-wẹ́bù sunwọ̀n si nínú àwọn irinṣẹ́ ìwọ̀n iyára ojú-wẹ́bù. Àwọn kan nínú wọn nílò iṣẹ́ ìṣẹ̀dá lórí ẹ̀rọ ayélujára, èyí tí kò sí nínú ẹ̀rọ-ìṣètò yìí, nítorí náà wọn kò ní ipa kankan.','Advanced (Recommended)'=>'Ilọsiwaju (A ṣe iṣeduro rẹ)','Everything in Basic, Plus'=>'Ohun gbogbo ninu Basic, Plus','Guest Mode and Guest Optimization'=>'Ipo Alejo ati Imudara Alejo','CSS, JS and HTML Minification'=>'Fífekúrú CSS, JS àti HTML','JS Defer for both external and inline JS'=>'JS Defer fun mejeeji ita ati in-line JS','DNS Prefetch for static files'=>'DNS Prefetch fun awọn faili aimsọ','Remove Query Strings from Static Files'=>'Yọ Awọn Ìbéèrè Ìbéèrè Kúrò Lórí Awọn Fáìlì Tí Kò Yípadà','This preset is good for most websites, and is unlikely to cause conflicts. Any CSS or JS conflicts may be resolved with Page Optimization > Tuning tools.'=>'Àwọn ètò yìí dára fún ọ̀pọ̀ jù lọ àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́ẹ̀bù, kò sì ní fa ìforígbárí kankan. Eyikeyi ìforígbárí CSS tàbí JS ni a lè yanjú pẹ̀lú Page Optimization > Tuning tools.','Includes many optimizations known to improve page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'O ni ọpọlọpọ awọn ilọsiwaju ti a mọ lati mu awọn ami iyara oju-iwe dara si. Diẹ ninu wọn nilo iṣẹ iran ori ayelujara, eyiti ko si ninu afikun yii, ati pe awọn wọnyẹn ko ni ipa kankan.','Aggressive'=>'Kíkankùn','Everything in Advanced, Plus'=>'Gbogbo ohun ti o wa ninu To ti ni ilọsiwaju, Plus','CSS & JS Combine'=>'Isopọ CSS & JS','Asynchronous CSS Loading with Critical CSS'=>'Àìsopọ̀-akókò CSS Gbigbe pẹ̀lu CSS Tó Léròpọ̀','Removed Unused CSS for Users'=>'Ti yọ CSS ti a kò lò kuro fun Awọn olumulo','Lazy Load for Iframes'=>'Fifẹ Ọlẹ fun Awọn Iframes','This preset might work out of the box for some websites, but be sure to test! Some CSS or JS exclusions may be necessary in Page Optimization > Tuning.'=>'Eto tẹlẹ yii le ṣiṣẹ lẹsẹkẹsẹ fun diẹ ninu awọn oju opo wẹẹbu, ṣugaye ri to daju pe o danwo! Diẹ ninu awọn imukuro CSS tabi JS le jẹ dandan ni Page Optimization > Tuning.','Extreme'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀','Everything in Aggressive, Plus'=>'Ohun gbogbo ti o wa ninu Aggressive, Plọọsi','Lazy Load for Images'=>'Ìṣẹ́ Ìkún Ọ̀fẹ́ fún àwọn Àwòrán','Viewport Image Generation'=>'Ṣíṣdá Aworan Ibi-iwòye','JS Delayed'=>'A ti dẹkun JS','Inline JS added to Combine'=>'JS ti a fi kun Inline si Combine','Inline CSS added to Combine'=>'CSS tó wà nínú ìlà tí a fi kún Combine','This preset almost certainly will require testing and exclusions for some CSS, JS and Lazy Loaded images. Pay special attention to logos, or HTML-based slider images.'=>'Ìtò sílẹ̀ yìí fẹ́rẹ̀ẹ́ má a nílò àwọn ìdánwò àti àwọn àyàsọ́tọ̀ fún díẹ̀ lára CSS, JS àti àwọn àwòrán tí a kó wọlé lọ́fẹ̀ẹ́ (Lazy Loaded). Fi ojú àkànṣe sí àwọn àwòrán àmì-ìdánimọ̀ (logos), tàbí àwọn àwòrán sálídà tí ó dá lórí HTML.','Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect.'=>'Ó mú kí ìpele gíga jù lọ ti ìmúṣẹ dára sí i ṣiṣẹ́ fún àwọn àmì ìṣe ìṣojú ojú-ewé tí ó sunwọ̀n sí i. Àwọn mìíràn nínú wọn nílò iṣẹ́ ìdánimọ̀ orí-ayélujára, èyí tí kò sí nínú àfikún yìí, àti pé àwọn wọ̀nyẹn kò ní ipa kankan.','Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets'=>'Awọn Ìṣètò Ìpilẹṣẹ Ẹrọ Ifipamọ Zinn® Standard','Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between.'=>'Lo àṣàyàn ti LiteSpeed ṣe fún ìtòlẹ́sẹẹsẹ ààyè rẹ̀ pẹ̀lu ì tẹ́ ìkan péré. Gbìyànjú àwọn ohun pàtàkì tí kò ní ewu nínú, ìṣètò tó ga jùlọ, tàbí ohun kan láàrin wọn.','Who should use this preset?'=>'Ta ni o yẹ ki o lo àwọn ìlànà wọ̀nyí?','This will back up your current settings and replace them with the %1$s preset settings. Do you want to continue?'=>'Èyí yóò ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún àwọn ètò rẹ̀ lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ yóò sì fi àwọn ètò ìṣètò tẹ́lẹ̀ %1$s rọ́pò wọn. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Apply Preset'=>'Fi àṣàyàn sílẹ̀','unknown'=>'àìmọ̀','History'=>'Ìtàn','Error: Failed to apply the settings %1$s'=>'Àṣìṣe: Kò le fi àwọn ètò %1$s sílò','Restored backup settings %1$s'=>'Awọn Eto afẹyinti ti a mu pada %1$s','Applied the %1$s preset %2$s'=>'Ti lo iṣeto tẹlẹ %1$s %2$s','Backup created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset'=>'A ște afẹ́hinti ti a dá ni %1$s kí a tó lo ètò ìṣáájú %2$s','This will restore the backup settings created %1$s before applying the %2$s preset. Any changes made since then will be lost. Do you want to continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú àwọn ètò àkópamọ́ tí a dá %1$s ṣáájú kí a tó lo àṣàyàn %2$s padà. Eyikeyi iyipada ti a ṣe lati igba naa yoo sọnu. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀síwájú?','Restore Settings'=>'Mọ́padà sí àwọn ètò náà','Zinn® Cache Engine View .htaccess'=>'Zinn® Cache Engine Wo .htaccess','.htaccess Path'=>'Ọ̀nà .htaccess','Frontend .htaccess Path'=>'Ojú Ọ̀nà .htaccess Ìpìlẹ̀ Iṣẹ́','Default path is'=>'Ọ̀nà àìṣàyẹ̀wù jẹ́','PHP Constant %s is supported.'=>'A tìlẹ́yìn fún PHP Constant %s.','You can use this code %1$s in %2$s to specify the htaccess file path.'=>'O le lo koodu yii %1$s ninu %2$s lati sọ opopona faili htaccess pato.','Backend .htaccess Path'=>'Ọ̀nà .htaccess ti Ẹhin (Backend)','Current %s Contents'=>'Awọn akoonu %s lọwọlọwọ','View .htaccess'=>'Wo .htaccess','Heartbeat'=>'Ìpínlẹ̀ Ọkàn','Debug Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Ìdánwò','Log View'=>'Wo Ibo Logi','Zinn® Cache Engine Toolbox'=>'Apoti Irinṣẹ Ẹrọ Ikojọpọ Zinn®','Heartbeat Control'=>'Ìṣàkóso Ìlù Ọkàn','Disable WordPress interval heartbeat to reduce server load.'=>'Mu ìgbbà ìpínlẹ̀-ọkàn WordPress kuro lati dinku ẹru lori sẹ́fà.','Disabling this may cause WordPress tasks triggered by AJAX to stop working.'=>'Ìdínkù èyí lè fà á kí àwọn iṣẹ́ WordPress tí AJAX ń bẹ̀rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kanjẹ́ dáwọ́ ṣíṣe.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on frontend.'=>'Tan si lati ṣakoso lu ọkan lori frontend.','Specify the %s heartbeat interval in seconds.'=>'Ṣe alaye àlàfo ìgbà ààyè ìbùkùn ọkàn %s ní àwọn ìṣẹ́jú ààyè.','WordPress valid interval is %s seconds.'=>'Ààyè tí ó tọ́ fún WordPress jẹ́ %s ìṣẹ́jú ààyè.','Set to %1$s to forbid heartbeat on %2$s.'=>'Fi si %1$s lati kọ̀ láti jẹ́ kí heartbeat wà lórí %2$s.','Turn ON to control heartbeat on backend.'=>'Tan IN lati dari ikun-inu okan lori backend.','Turn ON to control heartbeat in backend editor.'=>'Tan an lati ṣakoso lilọ ọkan ninu olutunṣe abẹle.','Export Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Ìkọjáde','Export'=>'Wọ ọja kọ jade','Last exported'=>'Àwọn tó kẹ́yìn jáde','This will export all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings and save them as a file.'=>'Èyí yóò kó gbogbo ètò Zinn® Cache Engine lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́ báyìí jáde, yóò sì fi pamọ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí fáìlì kan.','Import Settings'=>'Àwọn Ètò Ìgbéwọlé','Import'=>'Gbe wọle','Last imported'=>'Ti a gbe wọle kẹhin','This will import settings from a file and override all current Zinn® Cache Engine settings.'=>'Eyi yoo gbe awọn eto wọle lati inu faili kan yoo si sọ gbogbo awọn eto Zinn® Cache Engine ti o wa lọwọlọwọ di asan.','Reset All Settings'=>'TúnGbogboÀwọnÈtòṢe','This will reset all settings to default settings.'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo àwọn ètò padà sí àwọn ètò ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ aláfàárọ̀.','Are you sure you want to reset all settings back to the default settings?'=>'Ṣe o ni idaniloju pe o fẹ tun gbogbo awọn eto pada si awọn eto aiyipada?','Reset Settings'=>'Tún Ètò Ṣe','Purge Log'=>'Nu Àkọsílẹ Kúrò','Crawler Log'=>'Akọọlu Crawler','LiteSpeed Logs'=>'Àkọsílẹ LiteSpeed','Clear Logs'=>'Pa Àwọn Àkọsílẹ́ rẹ́','Click to copy'=>'Tẹ láti daakọ','Copy Log'=>'Da Àkọsílẹ̀ Ẹ̀dà','Click to download'=>'Tẹ láti ṣe igbasilẹ','Download'=>'Ṣe igbasilẹ','Purge Front Page'=>'Nu Oju Ewe Akọkọ jade','This will Purge Front Page only'=>'Èyí yóò pa ojú ìwé àkọkọ rẹ́ nìkan','Purge Pages'=>'Pa Awọn oju-iwe rẹ nu','This will Purge Pages only'=>'Èyí yóò kó àwọn ojú-ewé nìkan kúrò','Purge %s Error'=>'Pa Aṣiṣe %s rẹ','Purge %s error pages'=>'Pa awọn oju-iwe aṣiṣe %s kuro','Purge the LiteSpeed cache entries created by this plugin'=>'Pa awọn titẹ sii akọọlẹ LiteSpeed ti a ṣẹda nipasẹ afikun yii rẹ','This will purge all minified/combined CSS/JS entries only'=>'Èyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn wẹ́nsì/dídọ́pọ̀ CSS/JS tí a ti dín kù rẹ́ nìkan','Purge all the object caches'=>'Pa gbogbo awọn àkópọ̀ ohun kuro','Reset the entire opcode cache'=>'Tún iye opcode cache ṣe patapata','Critical CSS'=>'CSS Òpópó-ìtọ́nisọ́nà Tó ṣe Pàtàkì Jùlọ','This will delete all generated critical CSS files'=>'Èyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn fáìlì CSS pàtàkì tí a ti dá sílẹ́ rẹ́','Unique CSS'=>'CSS Ẹlẹṣọ Kọ̀kan','This will delete all generated unique CSS files'=>'Èyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn fáìlì CSS aláìlẹ́gbẹ́ tí a dá sílẹ́ rẹ́','This will delete all localized resources'=>'Eyi yoo pa gbogbo awọn ohun elo agbegbe rẹ rẹ','This will delete all generated image LQIP placeholder files'=>'Èyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn fáìlì ibi ìpamọ́ aworan LQIP tí a dá rẹ́ kẹ́gẹ́','This will delete all generated Viewport Images'=>'Eyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn Àwòrán Viewport tí a dá sílẹ̀ rẹ́','This will delete all cached Gravatar files'=>'Èyí yóò pa gbogbo àwọn fáìlì Gravatar tí a fi pamọ́ rẹ́','Purge the cache entries created by this plugin except for Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches'=>'Pa awọn ìwé ìpamọ́ (cache entries) tí afikun (plugin) yìí dá silẹ rẹ àyafi Critical CSS & Unique CSS & LQIP caches','Empty Entire Cache'=>'Segbe Gbogbo rẹ̀ Nu','Clears all cache entries related to this site, including other web applications.'=>'Yọ gbogbo àwọn ìpín cache tí ó ní í ṣe pẹ̀lú ojú òpó wẹ́bù yìí lára, títí kan àwọn ìlò wẹ́bù mìíràn.','This action should only be used if things are cached incorrectly.'=>'O yẹ ki a lo iṣe yii nikan ti a ba fi ohun pamọ (cache) ni ọna ti ko tọ.','This will clear EVERYTHING inside the cache.'=>'Èyí yóò pa ohun gbogbo rẹ́ pátápátá inú káṣì náà.','This may cause heavy load on the server.'=>'Èyí lè fa ẹ̀rù iṣẹ́ tó pọ̀ sórí sẹ́fà (server) náà.','If only the WordPress site should be purged, use Purge All.'=>'Tí o bá jẹ́ pé ojula WordPress nìkan ni ó yẹ kí a sọ di mímọ́, lò Purge All.','Purge By...'=>'Fi rẹ...','Select below for "Purge by" options.'=>'Yan ni isalẹ fun awọn aṣayan "Purge by".','Category'=>'Ẹ̀ka','Post ID'=>'ID Ifiranṣẹ','Tag'=>'Àmì','Purge pages by category name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Pa gbogbo ojú-ewé rẹ́ jẹ́ nípa lílo orúkọ ẹ̀ka - fún àpẹẹrẹ, a gbọ́dọ̀ lo %2$s fún URL %1$s.','Purge pages by post ID.'=>'Pa awọn oju-iwe rẹ nu nipa lilo ID ifiweranṣẹ.','Purge pages by tag name - e.g. %2$s should be used for the URL %1$s.'=>'Pa oju-iwe kuro nipasẹ orukọ taagi - bi apeere %2$s yẹ ki o lo fun URL %1$s.','Purge pages by relative or full URL.'=>'Nu awọn oju-iwe kuro nipasẹ URL ibatan tabi kikun.','e.g. Use %1$s or %2$s.'=>'b.a. Lo %1$s tabi %2$s.','Purge List'=>'Akojọ Ìfọ̀mọ́','Debug Helpers'=>'Àwọn Olùrànlọ́wọ́ Ìṣàtúnṣe Aṣìṣe','View Site Before Optimization'=>'Wo Ojula Koju K To Se Atunse','View Site Before Cache'=>'Wo Aaye Ṣaju kaṣi','Disable All Features for 24 Hours'=>'Mu Gbogbo Awọn Ẹya kuro fún Wakati 24','Remove `Disable All Feature` Flag Now'=>'Yọ Asìá `Disable All Feature` Bayìí','Zinn® Cache Engine is temporarily disabled until: %s.'=>'A ti pa Zinn® Cache Engine rẹ́ fún ìgbà díẹ̀ títí di: %s.','This will disable LSCache and all optimization features for debug purpose.'=>'Eyi yoo mu LSCache kuro ati gbogbo awọn ẹya iṣapejuwe fun idi idibajẹ.','Admin IP Only'=>'IP Alákòóso nìkan','Outputs to a series of files in the %s directory.'=>'Ó ń jáde sí sísẹ́lẹ̀ àwọn fáìlì nínú ìtọ́kasí %s.','To prevent filling up the disk, this setting should be OFF when everything is working.'=>'Lati dena kíkún disk náà, ètò yìí yẹ kí ó wà ní PIPA nígbà tí ohun gbogbo bá ń ṣiṣẹ́ daradara.','The Admin IP option will only output log messages on requests from admin IPs listed below.'=>'Aṣayan IP Admin yoo jade awọn ifiranṣẹ log nikan lori awọn ibeere lati awọn IP admin ti a ṣe akoṣo rẹ ni isalẹ.','Allows listed IPs (one per line) to perform certain actions from their browsers.'=>'O gba laaye fun awọn IP ti a ṣe akoṣo rẹ (ọkan fun ila kọọkan) lati ṣe awọn iṣẹ kan lati awọn ayarakatọ wọn.','Your IP'=>'IP Rẹ','More information about the available commands can be found here.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ alaye nipa awọn aṣẹ ti o wa ni a le rii nibi.','Advanced level will log more details.'=>'Ipele to ga julọ yoo ṣe igbasilẹ awọn alaye diẹ sii.','MB'=>'MB','Specify the maximum size of the log file.'=>'Ṣọ̀ títóbi jù lọ fáìlì ìwé ìrántí náà.','Shorten query strings in the debug log to improve readability.'=>'Se awọn okun ibeere ninu ogbontigi iṣoro kuku lati mu ki o rọrun lati ka.','Only log listed pages.'=>'Ṣe àkọsílẹ̀ àwọn ojú-ewé tí a tò pọ̀ nìkan.','Prevent any debug log of listed pages.'=>'Dena eyikeyi wọọlu aṣiṣe (debug log) ti awọn oju-iwe ti a ṣe akoṣo rẹ.','Prevent writing log entries that include listed strings.'=>'Dena kikọ awọn titẹ sii log ti o ni awọn okun ti a ṣe akoṣo ninu.','Cache Engine'=>'Ẹrọ Ìpamọ́ Ìgbàgbọ́','Overview'=>'Àkópọ̀','Web server'=>'Fọ́nṣán wẹ́bù','not reported'=>'kò tíì jábọ̀','Version'=>'Ẹ̀yà','This server is not running LiteSpeed.'=>'Ko si LiteSpeed ​​ti nṣiṣẹ lori sẹ́fà yìí.','Everything else here works — image optimisation, the database cleaner, the CDN — but full-page caching needs LiteSpeed at the web server, so pages are not being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard.'=>'Gbogbo ohun miiran nibi n ṣiṣẹ — ìṣàfikún àwòrán, afọmọ́ ibi ìpamọ́ data, CDN — ṣùgbọ́n caching ojú-ewé kíkún ń béèrè fún LiteSpeed ní sẹ́fà wẹ́bù, nítorí náà a kò ń kó àwọn ojú-ewé sí ibi ìpamọ́. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alábòójútó rẹ̀ bóyá LiteSpeed wà, tàbí kí o lọ sí ibi ìgbékalẹ̀ Zinn® níbi tí ó ti jẹ́ ìlànà déédéé.','See Zinn® hosting'=>'Wo hosting Zinn®','LiteSpeed is running and full-page caching is available.'=>'LiteSpeed nṣiṣẹ ati pe cachingioju-kikun wa.','The engine’s own settings — caching, image optimisation, the database cleaner, the crawler and the CDN — live on its own menu. This screen carries the things Zinn Digital® adds: the status above, a report you can send to support, and the shared import and export.'=>'Awọn eto ti ẹrọ naa funrarẹ — caching, iṣapeye aw getImage, olutọju database, crawler ati CDN — wa lori akojọ aṣayan tirẹ. Iboju yii ni awọn nkan ti Zinn Digital® fi kun: ipgetStatus ti o wa loke, ijabọ kan ti o le firanṣẹ si atilẹyin, ati gbigbe wọle ati gbigbe jade ti o pin.','Open the cache engine settings'=>'Ṣí ètò ẹ̀rọ ìpamọ́kọ̀ọ́ (cache engine)','Cache settings'=>'Ètò kaṣe','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wọ̀ ìdúróṣinṣin ti imudojuiwọn ti a ṣe igbasilẹ náà kù, a ò sì fi í sori ẹrọ náà.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Ti fipamọ. Tẹ iye tuntun kan lati rọpo rẹ.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Se àtòjọ yìí lẹ́kùn-únrẹ́rẹ́','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o ba àlẹmọ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi ìlà kan kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ila yii kuro','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo ohun 🔌 Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Kò nílò àsopọ̀ kankan fún plọ́ọ̀gìn yìí.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí awọn ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni àṣẹ láti yí àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí padà.','Settings sections'=>'Awọn apakan eto','Support'=>'Atilẹyin','Save changes'=>'Fi àwọn àtúnṣe pamọ́','Tools'=>'Àwọn ohunèlò','Export settings'=>'Awọn eto igbasilẹ jade','Reset to defaults'=>'Tun to si àwọn ohun àkọ́kọ́','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Eyi yoo da gbogbo eto lori plọọgi yii pada si ipilẹṣẹ wọn. Ṣe o fẹ tẹsiwaju?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àwọn àyẹ̀wò fún ìtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Gbe faili awọn eto wọle wọle','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Awọn dosié ti a gbe jade kò ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínrí (passwords), àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀ (tokens) tàbí àwọn bọ́tìnnì API — wàá nílò láti tún wọn sí ãyè lórí ojú-wẹ́bù tuntun náà.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fipamọ awọn eto naa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lori plugin yii ti pada si ipinlẹ atilẹba wọn.','Done.'=>'Ó ti ṣe.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A kò lè ka fáìlì yẹn. Yan fáìlì ètò tí a gbé wọlé láti inú plọọgìnnì Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìṣàfihàn àwọn ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kọ́ jẹ́ ìṣejade ètò Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A fi fáìlì yẹn sọjade lati inu àfikún mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà, wíwọlé rẹ̀ sí ibi yii yoo fipamọ́ àwọn ètò tí àfikún yii ko le mọ̀.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Ohun ètò %d wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì ìjápọ̀ API kì í wà nínú ohun tí a kó jáde, nítorí náà tẹ wọ́n sílẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'Ńsopọ̀ lọ́wọ́ lọ…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Sopọ, ṣugbọn ohun kan nilo akiyesi','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Ṣiṣẹ lori akọọlẹ rẹ ti ara ẹni','We could not check this'=>'A kò lè ṣàyẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Plugin yìí kò sọ ìdí rẹ̀. Fi ìرòhìn àyẹ̀wò ranṣẹ́ sí wa, a ó sì wo o.','Connection status'=>'Ipo asopọ','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Wọn ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ kẹ́yìn ní %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó ń ṣí sí taabu tuntun kan)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi è ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sì sí ohun tí ó pamọ́. Àwọn ọrọ̀ aṣínà rẹ, àwọn àmì ìdánimọ̀ rẹ, àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Iroyin iwadii aisan ti ao ranṣẹ','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ṣe àakọ sí pẹpẹ ìṣiṣẹ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ranṣẹ sí àtìlẹyìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tìkẹ́tì àtìlẹ́yìn fún ọ, a sì ń dáhùn nípa í-mélì. Bí o kò bá fẹ́ ránṣẹ́ rẹ̀, da ẹ̀kọ́ rẹ̀ sí òkè, kí o sì lẹ mọ́ inú tìkẹ́tì fúnra rẹ.','Copied'=>'Wọ́n ti daakọ rẹ̀','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati sevà yii (%s). Da iroyin oke yoo ko si ṣii tiketi kan dipo rẹ — ko si ohun ti ko tọ si awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Atileyin Zinn® ti gba ijabọ rẹ yoo si dahun nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Atilẹyin Zinn® gba ijabọ rẹ — itọkasi %s — yoo si fesi nipasẹ imeeli.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìjábọ̀ ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú díẹ̀ kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i — àwọn tí tẹ́lẹ̀ dé ní.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ko le gba ijabọ naa ni bayi — o jẹ ewu tiwa, kii ṣe ti rẹ. Gbiyanju lẹẹkan si laipẹ, tabi daakọ ijabọ ti o wa loke sinu tikẹti kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ̀ láti gba ìròyìn náà (HTTP %d). Da a sọ́kè kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́tì kan, kí o sì tọka si nọ́mbà yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ni àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Awọn itọnisọna olumulo','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gbale Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfmọ̀ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣílọ ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó rọrùn fún àwọn tó ní ju ojú opó kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra àti ta àwọn ojú-wọ̀sẹ̀, àwọn agbègbè, àti àwọn ibi ìsopọ̀ tí ó ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀, pẹ̀lú owó tí a fi àìléwu pa mọ́ títí tí àwọn ẹ̀gbẹ́ méjèèjì yóò fi ní ìtẹ́lọ́rùn.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn olómìnira kárí ayé wa: wínilójú lórí ẹgbẹ̀rún mẹ́wàá iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ látọwọ́ àwọn olùkọ̀wé, apẹrẹ, olùgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn onímọ̀ SEO, tàbí fi iṣẹ́ kan sọ́tọ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún ní iye owó.','Style preset'=>'Ohun àṣàyàn fún ìrísí','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kan. Ohunkohun tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yoo sọ ọ́ di asan.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo awọn awọ ati iwọn mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi silẹ ni pipa ati pe a lo aṣayan tẹlẹ gẹgẹ bi o ṣe wa gangan.']];